digo que permite a servidor y cliente importar contratos compartidos","fr":"Shared-model-refactor est une technique de refactoring de code qui permet au serveur et au client d''importer des contrats partagés","de":"Shared-model-refactor ist eine Technik zur Refactoring von Code, die es ermöglicht, dass Server und Client gemeinsame Verträge importieren","pt":"O que é Shared Model Refactor? É um framework para refactorar código React e reduzir a sobrecarga","ru":"Что такое Shared Model Refactor? Это фреймворк для рефакторинга кода React и снижения нагрузки","ar":"ما هو Shared Model Refactor؟ إنه إطار عمل لتحسين أداء التطبيقات React من خلال إعادة هيكلة الكود"},"features":{"en":["Identifies boundary violations using rg command","Moves pure contracts such as interfaces and type aliases","Refactors code to import shared contracts from sampleImplementation/models/","Supports workflow automation using commands like rg -n","Helps developers identify movable symbols such as interfaces and type aliases","Enables server and client-side applications to import shared contracts"],"zh":["使用rg命令查找边界违规","识别可移动符号，包括接口和类型别名","减少服务器和客户端之间的依赖","简化React应用开发","支持React应用最小化重构"],"ja":["rgコマンドを使用して境界違反を検出","移動可能なシンボルを識別、インターフェイスと型エイリアスを含む","サーバーとクライアント間の依存関係を最小限に抑える","Reactアプリの開発を簡素化","Reactアプリの最小オーバーヘッドをサポート"],"ko":["rg 명령을 사용하여 경계 위반을 검색","이동 가능한 심볼을 식별, 인터페이스와 타입 에이リア스를 포함","서버와 클라이언트 간의 의존성을 최소화","리액트 애플리케이션 개발을 단순화","리액트 애플리케이션의 최소 오버헤드를 지원"],"es":["Refactorización de código para importar contratos compartidos","Reducción de la sobrecarga en aplicaciones React","Uso de interfaces y tipos puros para la refactorización","Identificación de violaciones de límites y símbolos movibles","Integración con herramientas de línea de comandos como rg"],"fr":["Refactoring de code pour importer des contrats partagés","Réduction de la charge dans les applications React","Utilisation d''interfaces et de types purs pour la refactoring","Identification de violations de limites et de symboles mobiles","Intégration avec des outils de ligne de commande comme rg"],"de":["Refactoring von Code, um gemeinsame Verträge zu importieren","Reduzierung des Overhead in React-Anwendungen","Verwendung von Schnittstellen und reinen Typen für die Refactoring","Identifizierung von Grenzverletzungen und beweglichen Symbolen","Integration mit Befehlszeilen-Tools wie rg"],"pt":["Refatoração de código para importar contratos compartilhados","Redução da sobrecarga em aplicações React","Uso de interfaces e tipos puros para mover símbolos","Identificação de violações de limites com `rg`","Suporte à CLI para execução de comandos"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода для импорта общих контрактов","Снижение нагрузки в React-приложениях","Использование интерфейсов и чистых типов для перемещения символов","Обнаружение нарушений границ с помощью `rg`","Поддержка CLI для выполнения команд"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود لاستيراد العقود المشتركة","تحسين أداء التطبيقات React","استخدام الواجهات والأنواع النقية لنقل الرموز","اكتشاف انتهاكات الحدود باستخدام `rg`","دعم CLI لتشغيل الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use shared-model-refactor","shared-model-refactor react optimization","shared-model-refactor alternative","shared-model-refactor vs react optimization tools","shared-model-refactor install","shared-model-refactor setup guide","react app optimization techniques","shared-model-refactor benefits","shared-model-refactor tutorial"],"zh":["共享模型重构","React应用开发","最小化重构","服务器和客户端之间的依赖","AIエージェント","rg命令","边界违规"],"ja":["共有モデルリファクタリング","Reactアプリ開発","最小オーバーヘッド","サーバーとクライアント間の依存関係","AIエージェント","rgコマンド","境界違反"],"ko":["공유 모델 리팩토링","리액트 애플리케이션 개발","최소 오버헤드","서버와 클라이언트 간의 의존성","AI 에이전트","rg 명령","경계 위반"],"es":["shared-model-refactor","react","refactorización de código","aplicaciones react","herramientas de línea de comandos","optimización de rendimiento","reducción de sobrecarga","contratos compartidos","interfaces y tipos puros"],"fr":["shared-model-refactor","react","refactoring de code","applications react","outils de ligne de commande","optimisation des performances","réduction de la charge","contrats partagés","interfaces et types purs"],"de":["shared-model-refactor","react","code-refactoring","react-anwendungen","befehlszeilen-tools","leistungsoptimierung","reduzierung des overhead","gemeinsame verträge","schnittstellen und reine typen"],"pt":["Shared Model Refactor","React","refatoração de código","redução de sobrecarga","interfaces","tipos puros","CLI","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Shared Model Refactor","React","рефакторинг кода","снижение нагрузки","интерфейсы","чистые типы","CLI","разработка приложений","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Shared Model Refactor","React","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تحسين الأداء","الواجهات","الأنواع النقية","CLI","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"jts599","repo":"QuickApp","repoPath":"jts599/QuickApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T23:17:28Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shared-model-refactor","description":"Refactor shared server/client TypeScript contracts into a common models directory and eliminate cross-boundary imports (for example client importing server classes). Use when client code depends on server module exports for types or when generated client code needs DTO/view-data/method contracts without bundling server implementation files.","bodyPreview":"# Shared Model Refactor\n\nRefactor code so server and client both import shared contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/` instead of importing each other.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Find boundary violations.\n- Run:\n  - `rg -n \"from [''\\\"].*server/|from [''\\\"].*client/\" sampleImplementation src test -S`\n- Identify client imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*` and server imports from `sampleImplementation/client/*`.\n\n2. Identify movable symbols.\n- Move only pure contracts:\n  - interfaces\n  - type ali","body":"# Shared Model Refactor\n\nRefactor code so server and client both import shared contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/` instead of importing each other.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Find boundary violations.\n- Run:\n  - `rg -n \"from [''\\\"].*server/|from [''\\\"].*client/\" sampleImplementation src test -S`\n- Identify client imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*` and server imports from `sampleImplementation/client/*`.\n\n2. Identify movable symbols.\n- Move only pure contracts:\n  - interfaces\n  - type aliases\n  - enums/constants used as DTO/schema contracts\n- Do not move implementation/runtime code:\n  - decorated classes\n  - business logic\n  - DB/network utilities\n\n3. Create model files.\n- Place extracted contracts in `sampleImplementation/models/`.\n- Use feature-based files (for example `sampleImplementation/models/sampleView.ts`).\n- Keep files side-effect free.\n\n4. Update imports.\n- Update server and client to import contracts from `sampleImplementation/models/*`.\n- For NodeNext, use explicit `.js` extensions in TS imports.\n- Prefer `import type` for type-only imports.\n\n5. Update client generation templates/runtime.\n- Ensure generated client code imports contracts from `models/`, not server class modules.\n- If generator currently infers types via server class imports, switch generation to explicit model imports per controller.\n\n6. Regenerate generated client files.\n- Run generation command(s) after template changes.\n\n7. Validate.\n- Run:\n  - `npm run typecheck`\n  - `npm test`\n  - `cd sampleImplementation && npm run build`\n- Confirm no client file imports from `sampleImplementation/server/*`.\n\n## File Organization Rules\n\n- `sampleImplementation/models/` is the only shared contract boundary.\n- Server code may import from `models/` and `src/`.\n- Client code may import from `models/` and `src/client` runtime APIs.\n- Client code must not import from `sampleImplementation/server/`.\n\n## Refactor Heuristics\n\n- Keep model names aligned with domain language.\n- Split large contract files by feature, not by type-kind.\n- Do not duplicate contracts in both server and client.\n- If a contract is only used on one side, keep it local.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Zero cross-boundary implementation imports between `server/` and `client/`.\n- Shared DTO/view-data/method contracts live under `sampleImplementation/models/`.\n- Generated client output compiles and no longer depends on server class imports.\n- Full typecheck/tests/build pass.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:50:05.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Refactoring Agents needing advanced React optimization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级React优化能力的代码重构代理。","ja":"Reactの高度な最適化機能を必要とするコードリファクタリングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 React 최적화 기능이 필요한 코드 리팩토링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de refactorización de código que necesitan capacidades de optimización avanzadas de React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de refactoring de code nécessitant des capacités d''optimisation avancées de React.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Refactoring-Agents, die erweiterte React-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Refatoração de Código que precisam de capacidades de otimização avançadas do React.","ru":"Идеально для агентов рефакторинга кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации React.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إعادة هيكلة الكود الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности تحسين متقدمة من React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor code for shared contract imports, utilizing `rg` for boundary violation detection and optimizing server and client-side applications with movable symbols like interfaces and type aliases.","zh":"赋予代理重构代码以共享合同导入的能力，利用`rg`进行边界违规检测，并使用可移动的符号（如接口和类型别名）优化服务器和客户端应用程序。","ja":"エージェントにコードをリファクタリングして共有契約をインポートする機能を与え、`rg`を使用して境界違反を検出してサーバーとクライアント側のアプリケーションを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 공유 계약을 가져오기 위해 코드를 리팩토링 할 수 있도록 하며, `rg`를 사용하여 경계 위반을 감지하고 인터페이스 및 타입 별칭과 같은 이동 가능한 기호를 사용하여 서버 및 클라이언트측 애플리케이션을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar el código para importar contratos compartidos, utilizando `rg` para la detección de violaciones de límites y optimizar aplicaciones del lado del servidor y del cliente con símbolos movibles como interfaces y alias de tipo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser le code pour importer des contrats partagés, en utilisant `rg` pour la détection des violations de limites et en optimisant les applications côté serveur et côté client avec des symboles mobiles tels que des interfaces et des alias de type.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Code für die Importierung gemeinsamer Verträge umzuschreiben, indem `rg` für die Erkennung von Grenzverletzungen verwendet wird und Server- und Client-Seiten-Anwendungen mit beweglichen Symbolen wie Schnittstellen und Typaliasen optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refatorar o código para importações de contratos compartilhados, utilizando `rg` para detecção de violações de limite e otimizando aplicações de servidor e cliente com símbolos móveis, como interfaces e alias de tipo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью рефакторинга кода для импорта общих контрактов, используя `rg` для обнаружения нарушений границ и оптимизации серверных и клиентских приложений с подвижными символами, такими как интерфейсы и псевдонимы типов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إعادة هيكلة الكود لاستيراد العقود المشتركة، باستخدام `rg` لاكتشاف انتهاكات الحدود وتحسين التطبيقات على сторيف الخادم والعميل باستخدام رموز قابلة للنقل، مثل الواجهات والاسماء المستعارة للنوع."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring code to import shared contracts from a single location","Identifying and resolving boundary violations between server and client-side imports","Optimizing React apps by moving pure contracts to a centralized location"],"zh":["从单个位置导入共享合同的代码重构","在服务器和客户端导入之间识别和解决边界违规","通过将纯合同移到集中位置来优化React应用程序"],"ja":["単一の場所から共有契約をインポートするためのコードのリファクタリング","サーバーとクライアント側のインポート間の境界違反の特定と解決","純粋な契約を中央の場所に移動してReactアプリケーションを最適化する"],"ko":["단일 위치에서 공유 계약을 가져오기 위한 코드 리팩토링","서버 및 클라이언트측 가져오기 간의 경계 위반을 식별 및 해결","순수 계약을 중앙 위치로 이동하여 React 애플리케이션을 최적화"],"es":["Refactorizar el código para importar contratos compartidos desde una sola ubicación","Identificar y resolver violaciones de límites entre importaciones del lado del servidor y del cliente","Optimizar aplicaciones de React moviendo contratos puros a una ubicación centralizada"],"fr":["Refactoriser le code pour importer des contrats partagés à partir d''un seul emplacement","Identifier et résoudre les violations de limites entre les importations côté serveur et côté client","Optimiser les applications React en déplaçant les contrats purs vers un emplacement centralisé"],"de":["Code umschreiben, um gemeinsame Verträge von einem einzigen Ort aus zu importieren","Grenzverletzungen zwischen Server- und Client-Seiten-Importen identifizieren und beheben","React-Anwendungen optimieren, indem reine Verträge an einen zentralen Ort verschoben werden"],"pt":["Reorganizar o código para importar contratos compartilhados de um único local","Identificar e resolver violações de limite entre imports de servidor e cliente","Otimizar aplicativos React movendo contratos puros para um local centralizado"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода для импорта общих контрактов из одного места","Обнаружение и решение нарушений границ между импортом сервера и клиента","Оптимизация приложений React путем перемещения чистых контрактов в центральное место"],"ar":["إعادة تنظيم الكود لاستيراد العقود المشتركة من موقع واحد","التعرف على انتهاكات الحدود وحلها بين استيرادات الخادم والعميل","تحسين تطبيقات React من خلال نقل العقود النقية إلى موقع مركزي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to React application codebase","Limited to React applications with server and client-side components","Dependent on `rg` command-line tool for search functionality"],"zh":["需要访问React应用程序代码库","仅限于具有服务器和客户端组件的React应用程序","依赖于`rg`命令行工具进行搜索功能"],"ja":["Reactアプリケーションのコードベースへのアクセスが必要","サーバーとクライアント側のコンポーネントを持つReactアプリケーションに限定","検索機能に`rg`コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","서버 및 클라이언트측 구성 요소를 가진 React 애플리케이션에만 해당","`rg` 명령줄 도구에 대한 검색 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de la aplicación de React","Limitado a aplicaciones de React con componentes del lado del servidor y del cliente","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `rg` para la funcionalidad de búsqueda"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code de l''application React","Limité aux applications React avec des composants côté serveur et côté client","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `rg` pour la fonctionnalité de recherche"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis der React-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf React-Anwendungen mit Server- und Client-Seiten-Komponenten","Abhängig von der Befehlszeilentool `rg` für die Suchfunktion"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código da aplicação React","Limitado a aplicações React com componentes de servidor e cliente","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `rg` para funcionalidade de pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода приложения React","Ограничен для приложений React с компонентами сервера и клиента","Зависит от командной строки `rg` для функциональности поиска"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات تطبيق React","محدود للتطبيقات React التي تحتوي على مكونات الخادم والعميل","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `rg` للوظائف البحثية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"6be48008c697d4398d15706db0ab049ad1e753a0139123d7c695e0db77fb2ae1","qualityScore":32}');
