INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jts599/QuickApp/shared-model-refactor', 'shared-model-refactor', 'jts599', 'QuickApp', 'community', 'shared-model-refactor jts599 QuickApp community The shared-model-refactor skill helps developers optimize their React apps by refactoring code to import shared contracts from a single location. This benefits developers working on server and client-side applications. 共享模型重构是一种React应用框架，帮助开发者减少服务器和客户端之间的依赖 共有モデルリファクタリングは、Reactアプリの開発者がサーバーとクライアント間の依存関係を最小限に抑えることができるフレームワークです 공유 모델 리팩토링은 리액트 애플리케이션 개발자가 서버와 클라이언트 간의 의존성을 최소화할 수 있는 프레임워크입니다 Shared-model-refactor es un marco para crear aplicaciones React con mínima sobrecarga, permitiendo la refactorización de código para que servidor y cliente importen contratos compartidos Shared-model-refactor est un cadre pour créer des applications React avec une charge minimale, permettant la refactoring du code pour que le serveur et le client importent des contrats partagés Shared-model-refactor ist ein Rahmenwerk für die Erstellung von React-Anwendungen mit minimalem Overhead, ermöglicht die Refactoring von Code, damit Server und Client gemeinsame Verträge importieren O Shared Model Refactor é um framework para criar aplicações React com mínima sobrecarga, permitindo a refatoração de código para importar contratos compartilhados Shared Model Refactor — это фреймворк для создания React-приложений с минимальной нагрузкой, позволяющий рефакторить код для импорта общих контрактов Shared Model Refactor هو إطار عمل لإنشاء تطبيقات React بخفيفة الحمل، مما يسمح بإعادة هيكلة الكود لاستيراد العقود المشتركة how to use shared-model-refactor shared-model-refactor react optimization shared-model-refactor alternative shared-model-refactor vs react optimization tools shared-model-refactor install shared-model-refactor setup guide react app optimization techniques shared-model-refactor benefits shared-model-refactor tutorial 共享模型重构 React应用开发 最小化重构 服务器和客户端之间的依赖 AIエージェント rg命令 边界违规 Identifies boundary violations using rg command Moves pure contracts such as interfaces and type aliases Refactors code to import shared contracts from sampleImplementation/models/ Supports workflow automation using commands like rg -n Helps developers identify movable symbols such as interfaces and type aliases Enables server and client-side applications to import shared contracts shared-model-refactor is a framework for optimizing React apps by refactoring code to import shared contracts from sampleImplementation/models/');
