ões BMAD","arquitetura de steps","configuração YAML","workflow de criação de PRD","análise de qualidade do PRD","Replit","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["bmad-validate-prd","проверка PRD","стандарты BMAD","шаговая архитектура","конфигурация YAML","рабочий процесс создания PRD","анализ качества PRD","Replit","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["بمد-تأكيد-prd","التحقق من وثائق PRD","معايير BMAD","هيكل الخطوات","تكوين YAML","تدفق عمل إنشاء وثائق PRD","تحليل جودة وثائق PRD","Replit","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"KatTate","repo":"Katalyst-Lexicon","repoPath":"KatTate/Katalyst-Lexicon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.777Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bmad-validate-prd","description":">","bodyPreview":"# BMAD Validate PRD Workflow\n\nThis skill activates the BMAD PRD Validation workflow. It reviews an existing\nPRD against BMAD standards through comprehensive quality assessment.\n\n## Activation\n\nWhen this skill is triggered, load and follow the workflow directly:\n\nRead fully and follow: `_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-prd/workflow-validate-prd.md`\n\nThe workflow uses step-file architecture with steps in `steps-v/` directory.\n- Configuration loading from `_bmad/bmm/config.yaml`\n- PRD fi","body":"# BMAD Validate PRD Workflow\n\nThis skill activates the BMAD PRD Validation workflow. It reviews an existing\nPRD against BMAD standards through comprehensive quality assessment.\n\n## Activation\n\nWhen this skill is triggered, load and follow the workflow directly:\n\nRead fully and follow: `_bmad/bmm/workflows/2-plan-workflows/create-prd/workflow-validate-prd.md`\n\nThe workflow uses step-file architecture with steps in `steps-v/` directory.\n- Configuration loading from `_bmad/bmm/config.yaml`\n- PRD file discovery and loading\n- Output: validation report\n\n## Workflow Steps (13 Steps + 1 Conditional Branch)\n\n1. **step-v-01-discovery** — Discover and load the PRD to validate, detect format\n2. **step-v-02-format-detection** — Format classification and structure analysis\n   - ↳ **step-v-02b-parity-check** — Parity check handler (conditional: auto-loaded for variant/legacy formats)\n3. **step-v-03-density-validation** — Information density validation (wordiness, filler, conciseness)\n4. **step-v-04-brief-coverage-validation** — Product brief coverage validation\n5. **step-v-05-measurability-validation** — Measurability validation (quantified success criteria)\n6. **step-v-06-traceability-validation** — Traceability validation (requirements linkage)\n7. **step-v-07-implementation-leakage-validation** — Implementation leakage detection (technology in requirements)\n8. **step-v-08-domain-compliance-validation** — Domain compliance validation\n9. **step-v-09-project-type-validation** — Project-type compliance validation\n10. **step-v-10-smart-validation** — SMART requirements validation\n11. **step-v-11-holistic-quality-validation** — Holistic quality assessment and rating\n12. **step-v-12-completeness-validation** — Completeness validation\n13. **step-v-13-report-complete** — Final report compilation, summary, and next steps\n\n## Commonly Missed Steps\n\n- ⚠️ **step-v-07-implementation-leakage** — Agents may skip leakage detection since it requires checking FRs/NFRs for technology-specific language. This is a critical quality gate.\n- ⚠️ **step-v-11-holistic-quality** — The holistic assessment provides the overall quality rating. Skipping it means no overall score.\n- ⚠️ **step-v-13-report-complete** — Final report step that compiles all findings and presents actionable options (edit, review, fix). Must not be skipped.\n- ⚠️ **Each validation step must be executed sequentially** — agents may try to batch multiple validations together. Each step must complete fully before the next begins.\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n- NEVER skip steps or optimize the sequence\n- NEVER auto-proceed past WAIT points — stop and wait for user input\n- ALWAYS read each step file completely before taking action\n- ALWAYS follow step-file architecture: load one step at a time, never look ahead\n- ALWAYS halt at menus and wait for user selection\n- Recommend using a different high-quality LLM for validation if available\n- Each validation step must produce findings independently — do not batch\n\n## What''s Next\n\nAfter validating a PRD, the typical next steps are:\n- If issues found: **Edit PRD (EP)** — fix the identified problems\n- If passed: **Create Architecture (CA)** or **Create UX (CU)**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:15:20.075Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing comprehensive PRD validation against BMAD standards.","zh":"非常适合需要对PRD进行全面验证以符合BMAD标准的开发代理","ja":"BMAD規格に従った包括的なPRD検証が必要な開発エージェントに最適","ko":"BMAD 표준에 따라 종합적인 PRD 검증이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una validación de PRD integral contra los estándares de BMAD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une validation de PRD complète contre les normes BMAD.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine umfassende PRD-Validierung gegen die BMAD-Standards benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de validação abrangente do PRD contra os padrões BMAD.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется всесторонняя проверка PRD на соответствие стандартам BMAD.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى تحقق شامل من مواصفات المنتج ضد معايير BMAD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review existing PRDs through a comprehensive quality assessment, leveraging the BMAD PRD Validation workflow and step-file architecture, with configuration loading from YAML files.","zh":"赋予代理查看现有PRD的能力，通过全面质量评估，利用BMAD PRD验证工作流程和步骤文件架构，并从YAML文件加载配置","ja":"BMAD PRD検証ワークフローとステップファイルアーキテクチャを利用し、YAMLファイルから設定を読み込むことで、既存のPRDの包括的な品質評価を実行するエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"BMAD PRD 검증 워크플로와 단계 파일 아키텍처를 활용하여 YAML 파일에서 구성 로드를 통해 기존 PRD에 대한 전체적인 품질 평가를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar los PRD existentes a través de una evaluación de calidad integral, aprovechando el flujo de trabajo de validación de PRD de BMAD y la arquitectura de archivos de paso, con carga de configuración desde archivos YAML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de passer en revue les PRD existants via une évaluation de la qualité globale, en exploitant le flux de travail de validation de PRD de BMAD et l''architecture de fichiers de pas, avec un chargement de configuration à partir de fichiers YAML.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, bestehende PRDs durch eine umfassende Qualitätsbewertung zu überprüfen, die den BMAD-PRD-Validierungs-Workflow und die Schritt-Datei-Architektur nutzt, mit Konfigurationsladung aus YAML-Dateien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar os PRDs existentes por meio de uma avaliação de qualidade abrangente, utilizando o fluxo de trabalho de validação do PRD do BMAD e a arquitetura de arquivo de etapas, com carregamento de configuração a partir de arquivos YAML.","ru":"Позволяет агентам просматривать существующие PRD через всестороннюю оценку качества, используя рабочий процесс проверки PRD BMAD и архитектуру файла шагов, с загрузкой конфигурации из файлов YAML.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة مواصفات المنتج الحالية من خلال تقييم ποιότητας شامل، مستخدمًا تدفق عمل التحقق من مواصفات المنتج BMAD وهندسة ملف الخطوات، مع تحميل التكوين من ملفات YAML."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating PRDs against BMAD standards","Automating quality assessments for development projects","Reviewing PRD configurations loaded from YAML files"],"zh":["验证PRD是否符合BMAD标准","自动化开发项目的质量评估","查看从YAML文件加载的PRD配置"],"ja":["BMAD規格に従ったPRDの検証","開発プロジェクトの品質評価の自動化","YAMLファイルから読み込まれたPRD設定の確認"],"ko":["BMAD 표준에 따른 PRD 검증","개발 프로젝트의 품질 평가 자동화","YAML 파일에서 로드된 PRD 구성 검토"],"es":["Validar PRDs contra los estándares de BMAD","Automatizar evaluaciones de calidad para proyectos de desarrollo","Revisar configuraciones de PRD cargadas desde archivos YAML"],"fr":["Valider les PRD contre les normes BMAD","Automatiser les évaluations de la qualité pour les projets de développement","Réviser les configurations de PRD chargées à partir de fichiers YAML"],"de":["PRDs gegen die BMAD-Standards validieren","Qualitätsbewertungen für Entwicklungsvorhaben automatisieren","PRD-Konfigurationen überprüfen, die aus YAML-Dateien geladen werden"],"pt":["Validar PRDs contra os padrões BMAD","Automatizar avaliações de qualidade para projetos de desenvolvimento","Revisar configurações de PRD carregadas a partir de arquivos YAML"],"ru":["Проверка PRD на соответствие стандартам BMAD","Автоматизация оценок качества для проектов разработки","Просмотр конфигураций PRD, загруженных из файлов YAML"],"ar":["التحقق من مواصفات المنتج ضد معايير BMAD","توفير تقييمات ποιότητας لأجل مشاريع التطوير","مراجعة تكوينات مواصفات المنتج المحملة من ملفات YAML"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Dependent on BMAD standards and workflow definitions","Limited to PRD validation against BMAD standards"],"zh":["需要访问_bmad/bmm/config.yaml","依赖于BMAD标准和工作流定义","仅限于对BMAD标准的PRD验证"],"ja":["_bmad/bmm/config.yamlへのアクセスが必要","BMAD規格とワークフロー定義に依存","BMAD規格へのPRD検証のみ"],"ko":["_bmad/bmm/config.yaml에 접근해야 함","BMAD 표준 및 워크플로 정의에 의존","BMAD 표준에 대한 PRD 검증만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Depende de los estándares y definiciones de flujo de trabajo de BMAD","Limitado a la validación de PRD contra los estándares de BMAD"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Dépend des normes et des définitions de flux de travail de BMAD","Limité à la validation de PRD contre les normes BMAD"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Hängt von den BMAD-Standards und Workflow-Definitionen ab","Begrenzt auf die Validierung von PRD gegen die BMAD-Standards"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Dependente dos padrões e definições de fluxo de trabalho do BMAD","Limitado à validação do PRD contra os padrões BMAD"],"ru":["Требует доступа к _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","Зависит от стандартов и определений рабочего процесса BMAD","Ограничен проверкой PRD на соответствие стандартам BMAD"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى _bmad/bmm/config.yaml","يعتمد على معايير BMAD وتعريفات سير العمل","محدود بالتحقق من مواصفات المنتج ضد معايير BMAD"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4c1e3e7f1338626128075c299284d0f906fc51c782e174a6ebf7929f4326370f","qualityScore":32}');
