 criar hooks personalizados para automatizar tarefas de desenvolvimento de jogos com o Hook-Development, incluindo validação de operações e integraç...","ru":"Узнайте, как создавать пользовательские хуки для автоматизации задач разработки игр с помощью Hook-Development, включая проверку операций и интеграцию внешни...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء hooks مخصصة لتحسين عمليات تطوير الألعاب باستخدام Hook-Development، بما في ذلك التحقق من العمليات وتكامل الأدوات الخارجية لآلات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"hook-development is an event-driven automation script editor for Flutter Desktop texture atlas editing, enabling context-aware validation and integration with external tools.","zh":"Hook 开发是一种用于扩展 Claude Code 插件的事件驱动自动化脚本","ja":"Hook 開発は、Claude Code プラグインを拡張するためのイベント駆動型自動化スクリプト","ko":"Hook 개발은 Claude Code 플러그인을 확장하기 위한 이벤트駆動 자동화 스크립트","es":"Hook-development es una tecnología de automatización de eventos para plugins de Claude Code","fr":"Le développement de hook est une technologie d''automatisation d''événements pour les plugins de Claude Code","de":"Hook-development ist eine Ereignisautomatisierungstechnologie für Claude Code-Plugins","pt":"Hook-Development é uma tecnologia de automação de eventos que permite a criação de hooks personalizados para desenvolvimento de jogos","ru":"Hook-Development - это технология автоматизации событий, позволяющая создавать пользовательские хуки для разработки игр","ar":"Hook-Development هي تقنية لتutomatización الأحداث تمكن من إنشاء hooks مخصصة لتطوير الألعاب"},"features":{"en":["Supports Prompt-Based Hooks for context-aware validation using LLM-driven decision making","Executes Command Hooks for deterministic checks using bash commands","Integrates with Claude Code events for automated workflows","Enables validation of operations and enforcement of policies","Adds context to workflows and integrates external tools"],"zh":["支持 Prompt-Based Hooks 和 Command Hooks","事件驱动的自动化脚本","扩展 Claude Code 插件","优化 Flutter 桌面游戏开发工作流","使用 LLM 驱动的决策","执行 Bash 命令"],"ja":["Prompt-Based Hooks と Command Hooks をサポート","イベント駆動型自動化スクリプト","Claude Code プラグインを拡張","Flutter デスクトップ ゲーム開発のワークフローを最適化","LLM ドライブの意思決定を使用","Bash コマンドを実行"],"ko":["Prompt-Based Hooks 및 Command Hooks 지원","이벤트駆動 자동화 스크립트","Claude Code 플러그인을 확장","Flutter 데스크탑 게임 개발 워크플로 최적화","LLM 구동 의사 결정을 사용","Bash 명령어 실행"],"es":["Prompt-Based Hooks para la toma de decisiones basada en LLM","Command Hooks para la ejecución de comandos Bash","Validación de operaciones mediante scripts de eventos","Integración de herramientas externas en flujos de trabajo","Compatibilidad con plugins de Claude Code"],"fr":["Prompt-Based Hooks pour la prise de décision basée sur LLM","Command Hooks pour l''exécution de commandes Bash","Validation des opérations via des scripts d''événements","Intégration d''outils externes dans les flux de travail","Compatibilité avec les plugins de Claude Code"],"de":["Prompt-Based Hooks für die Entscheidungsfindung basierend auf LLM","Command Hooks für die Ausführung von Bash-Befehlen","Validierung von Operationen durch Ereignisskripte","Integration externer Tools in Workflows","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code-Plugins"],"pt":["Criação de hooks personalizados para validação de operações","Integração de ferramentas externas para desenvolvimento de jogos","Suporte a Prompt-Based Hooks e Command Hooks","Execução de comandos bash para checks determinísticos","Utilização de LLM-driven decision making para validação de contexto"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских хуков для проверки операций","Интеграция внешних инструментов для разработки игр","Поддержка Prompt-Based Hooks и Command Hooks","Выполнение команд bash для детерминированных проверок","Использование LLM-driven принятия решений для проверки контекста"],"ar":["إنشاء hooks مخصصة للتحقق من العمليات","تكامل الأدوات الخارجية لتطوير الألعاب","دعم Prompt-Based Hooks و Command Hooks","تنفيذ أوامر bash للتحقق من القيم الحتمية","استخدام LLM-driven اتخاذ القرارات للتحقق من السياق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use hook-development","hook-development setup guide","hook-development alternative","hook-development vs Claude Code","what is hook-development","hook-development install","hook-development for game development","Flutter Desktop texture atlas editor","event-driven automation scripts"],"zh":["Hook 开发","Flutter 桌面游戏开发","事件驱动自动化脚本","Claude Code 插件","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks","LLM 驱动的决策","Bash 命令","游戏开发工作流"],"ja":["Hook 開発","Flutter デスクトップ ゲーム開発","イベント駆動型自動化スクリプト","Claude Code プラグイン","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks","LLM ドライブの意思決定","Bash コマンド","ゲーム開発ワークフロー"],"ko":["Hook 개발","Flutter 데스크탑 게임 개발","이벤트駆動 자동화 스크립트","Claude Code 플러그인","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks","LLM 구동 의사 결정을","Bash 명령어","게임 개발 워크플로"],"es":["hook-development","desarrollo de hook","automatización de eventos","validación de operaciones","integración de herramientas externas","plugins de Claude Code","LLM","Bash","scripts de eventos"],"fr":["développement de hook","hook-development","automatisation d''événements","validation des opérations","intégration d''outils externes","plugins de Claude Code","LLM","Bash","scripts d''événements"],"de":["hook-development","Ereignisautomatisierung","Validierung von Operationen","Integration externer Tools","Claude Code-Plugins","LLM","Bash","Ereignisskripte","Automatisierung von Workflows"],"pt":["hook-development","desenvolvimento de jogos","automação de eventos","validação de operações","integração de ferramentas externas","LLM-driven decision making","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks"],"ru":["hook-development","разработка игр","автоматизация событий","проверка операций","интеграция внешних инструментов","LLM-driven принятие решений","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["hook-development","تطوير الألعاب","تutomatización الأحداث","التحقق من العمليات","تكامل الأدوات الخارجية","LLM-driven اتخاذ القرارات","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks","آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"CANTAGESTUDIO","repo":"CosmicAtlasPacker","repoPath":"CANTAGESTUDIO/CosmicAtlasPacker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.299Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hook-development","description":"[Utility] Guide for developing Claude Code hooks - shell commands that execute automatically in response to tool calls and notifications. Use this when users want to create, debug, or optimize hooks for automating workflows like linting, formatting, notifications, or custom validations. Supports PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SubagentStop, SessionStart, SessionEnd, UserPromptSubmit, PreCompact, Notification events.","bodyPreview":"# Hook Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nHooks are event-driven automation scripts that execute in response to Claude Code events. Use hooks to validate operations, enforce policies, add context, and integrate external tools into workflows.\n\n## Hook Types\n\n### Prompt-Based Hooks (Recommended)\nUse LLM-driven decision making for context-aware validation.\n\n### Command Hooks\nExecute bash commands for deterministic checks.\n\n## Hook Events\n\n| Event | When | Use For |\n|-------|------|--","body":"# Hook Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nHooks are event-driven automation scripts that execute in response to Claude Code events. Use hooks to validate operations, enforce policies, add context, and integrate external tools into workflows.\n\n## Hook Types\n\n### Prompt-Based Hooks (Recommended)\nUse LLM-driven decision making for context-aware validation.\n\n### Command Hooks\nExecute bash commands for deterministic checks.\n\n## Hook Events\n\n| Event | When | Use For |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| PreToolUse | Before tool | Validation, modification |\n| PostToolUse | After tool | Feedback, logging |\n| UserPromptSubmit | User input | Context, validation |\n| Stop | Agent stopping | Completeness check |\n| SubagentStop | Subagent done | Task validation |\n| SessionStart | Session begins | Context loading |\n| SessionEnd | Session ends | Cleanup, logging |\n| PreCompact | Before compact | Preserve context |\n| Notification | User notified | Logging, reactions |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` - Project root path\n- `$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT` - Plugin directory\n- `$CLAUDE_ENV_FILE` - SessionStart only: persist env vars here\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use prompt-based hooks for complex logic\n- Use ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} for portability\n- Validate all inputs in command hooks\n- Set appropriate timeouts"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:24.862Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced event-driven automation and validation in Flutter game development","zh":"适合需要高级事件驱动自动化和验证的AI代理，如Claude Code和AutoGPT，特别是在Flutter游戏开发中","ja":"Claude CodeやAutoGPTのような、Flutterゲーム開発で高度なイベント駆動型自動化と検証が必要なAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Flutter 게임 개발에서 고급 이벤트 주도 자동화 및 유효성 검증이 필요한 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan automatización avanzada basada en eventos y validación en el desarrollo de juegos de Flutter","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une automatisation avancée basée sur les événements et une validation dans le développement de jeux Flutter","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine erweiterte ereignisgesteuerte Automatisierung und Validierung in der Flutter-Spielentwicklung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de automação avançada baseada em eventos e validação no desenvolvimento de jogos Flutter","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих передовой событийно-ориентированной автоматизации и проверки в разработке игр Flutter","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى تلقيم تلقائي متقدم مدفوع بالحدث وتحقق في تطوير ألعاب Flutter"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute event-driven automation scripts, validate operations, and enforce policies using LLM-driven decision making and bash commands, integrating seamlessly with Flutter Desktop texture atlas editors and supporting protocols like event-driven automation","zh":"赋予代理执行事件驱动自动化脚本、验证操作、强制执行策略的能力，使用LLM驱动的决策和bash命令，与Flutter Desktop纹理图集编辑器无缝集成，支持诸如事件驱动自动化的协议","ja":"LLM駆動の意思決定とbashコマンドを使用して、イベント駆動型自動化スクリプトの実行、操作の検証、ポリシーの適用を可能にし、Flutter Desktopテクスチャアトラスエディターとシームレスに統合し、イベント駆動型自動化などのプロトコルをサポートする","ko":"LLM 기반 의사 결정 및 bash 명령을 사용하여 이벤트 주도형 자동화 스크립트 실행, 작업 유효성 검증, 정책 적용을 가능하게 하며, Flutter Desktop 텍스처 아틀라스 편집기와无缝 통합하고, 이벤트 주도형 자동화 등과 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar scripts de automatización basada en eventos, validar operaciones y hacer cumplir políticas utilizando la toma de decisiones impulsada por LLM y comandos bash, integrándose de manera transparente con los editores de atlas de texturas de Flutter Desktop y compatibles con protocolos como la automatización basada en eventos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des scripts d''automatisation basée sur les événements, de valider les opérations et de faire respecter les politiques en utilisant la prise de décision pilotée par LLM et les commandes bash, s''intégrant en toute transparence avec les éditeurs d''atlas de textures de Flutter Desktop et prenant en charge des protocoles tels que l''automatisation basée sur les événements","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, ereignisgesteuerte Automatisierungsskripte auszuführen, Operationen zu validieren und Richtlinien mithilfe von LLM-gesteuerter Entscheidungsfindung und Bash-Befehlen durchzusetzen, und integriert sich nahtlos mit Flutter Desktop-Texture-Atlas-Editoren und unterstützt Protokolle wie ereignisgesteuerte Automatisierung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar scripts de automação baseada em eventos, validar operações e aplicar políticas usando decisões impulsionadas por LLM e comandos bash, integrando-se perfeitamente com editores de atlas de textura do Flutter Desktop e apoiando protocolos como automação baseada em eventos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять сценарии автоматизации, основанные на событиях, проверять операции и обеспечивать соблюдение политик с помощью решений, основанных на LLM, и команд bash, интегрируясь без проблем с редакторами текстур atlas Flutter Desktop и поддерживая протоколы, такие как автоматизация, основанная на событиях","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل سكريبتات تلقيم تلقائي مدفوعة بالحدث والتحقق من العمليات وفرض السياسات باستخدام اتخاذ القرارات المدفوعة بواسطة LLM وأوامر bash، وتكاملها بشكل متكامل مع محرري أطلس النسيج من Flutter Desktop ودعم بروتوكولات مثل تلقيم تلقائي مدفوع بالحدث"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating texture atlas validation","Generating context-aware validation scripts","Integrating external tools into Flutter game development workflows"],"zh":["自动化纹理图集验证","生成上下文感知验证脚本","将外部工具集成到Flutter游戏开发工作流中"],"ja":["テクスチャアトラスの検証の自動化","コンテキスト認識型検証スクリプトの生成","外部ツールのFlutterゲーム開発ワークフローへの統合"],"ko":["텍스처 아틀라스 유효성 검증 자동화","컨텍스트 인식 유효성 검증 스크립트 생성","외부 도구를 Flutter 게임 개발 워크플로에 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la validación del atlas de texturas","Generación de scripts de validación conscientes del contexto","Integración de herramientas externas en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de juegos de Flutter"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation de l''atlas de textures","Génération de scripts de validation sensibles au contexte","Intégration d''outils externes dans les flux de travail de développement de jeux Flutter"],"de":["Automatisierung der Validierung des Texture-Atlas","Generierung von kontextbewussten Validierungsskripten","Integration externer Tools in Flutter-Spielentwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação do atlas de textura","Gerar scripts de validação cientes do contexto","Integrar ferramentas externas nos fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de jogos Flutter"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку текстурного атласа","Генерировать контекстно-зависимые сценарии проверки","Интегрировать внешние инструменты в рабочие процессы разработки игр Flutter"],"ar":["تلقيم تلقائي التحقق من أطلس النسيج","توليد سكريبتات التحقق المدركة للسياق","تكامل أدوات خارجية في سير عمل تطوير ألعاب Flutter"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code or compatible AI Agent integration","Flutter Desktop environment necessary"],"zh":["需要Claude Code或兼容的AI代理集成","需要Flutter Desktop环境"],"ja":["Claude Codeまたは互換性のあるAIエージェントの統合が必要","Flutter Desktop環境が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 또는 호환되는 AI 에이전트 통합이 필요합니다","Flutter Desktop 환경이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere integración de Claude Code o compatible con AI Agent","Entorno de escritorio de Flutter necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de Claude Code ou un agent IA compatible","Environnement de bureau Flutter nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code- oder kompatiblen KI-Agents-Integration","Flutter-Desktop-Umgebung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer integração do Claude Code ou de um Agente de IA compatível","Ambiente de Flutter Desktop necessário"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция с Claude Code или совместимым агентом ИИ","Необходимо окружение Flutter Desktop"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل Claude Code أو وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي متوافق","بيئة Flutter Desktop ضرورية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"100b96f059481c5377f6f1c7ebd2955c3a9a817af1ab213103a7d49c473c1bee","qualityScore":32}');
