INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rahmatrdn/go-ch-manager/query-analyzer', 'query-analyzer', 'rahmatrdn', 'go-ch-manager', 'community', 'query-analyzer rahmatrdn go-ch-manager community The query-analyzer skill provides a structured workflow for analyzing and optimizing ClickHouse queries, benefiting database administrators and developers. It offers deep query and performance visibility. Query Analyzer 是一个用于管理和优化 ClickHouse 数据库的工具，提供深入的查询和性能可视性 Query Analyzer は ClickHouse データベースを管理および最適化するためのツールで、深いクエリとパフォーマンスの可視性を提供します Query Analyzer는 ClickHouse 데이터베이스를 관리 및 최적화하는 도구로, 깊은 쿼리와 성능 가시성을 제공합니다 Query-analyzer es una herramienta integral para gestionar, monitorear y optimizar bases de datos ClickHouse con visibilidad profunda de las consultas y el rendimiento Query-analyzer est un outil tout-en-un pour gérer, surveiller et optimiser les bases de données ClickHouse avec une visibilité approfondie des requêtes et des performances Query-analyzer ist ein umfassendes Tool zur Verwaltung, Überwachung und Optimierung von ClickHouse-Datenbanken mit einer tiefen Einblick in die Abfragen und Leistung O Query Analyzer é uma ferramenta completa para gerenciar e otimizar bancos de dados ClickHouse, oferecendo análise de consultas e visibilidade de desempenho aprofundada. Query Analyzer — это комплексный инструмент для управления и оптимизации баз данных ClickHouse, обеспечивающий анализ запросов и глубокую видимость производительности. Query Analyzer هو أداة شاملة لإدارة وتحسين قواعد بيانات ClickHouse، يوفر تحليل الاستفسارات ووضوح أداء متعمق how to use query-analyzer ClickHouse database optimization query-analyzer setup guide query-analyzer vs ClickHouse alternatives what is query-analyzer query-analyzer install ClickHouse query analysis query-analyzer tutorial query-analyzer documentation ClickHouse 查询分析 Query Analyzer AI 工具 数据库管理 查询优化 性能可视性 Schema 评估 Partition Key Sorting Key Performs schema assessment using SHOW CREATE TABLE or DESCRIBE TABLE commands Identifies Partition Key and Sorting Key (Primary Key) for query optimization Analyzes queries for filtering by Partition Key Provides checklist for query optimization Supports ClickHouse database performance monitoring query-analyzer is a comprehensive tool for managing, monitoring, and optimizing ClickHouse databases with detailed query analysis and performance insights.');
