mpétence qui utilise la stratégie conversationnelle pour améliorer la gestion de projets et de services dans les entreprises de SaaS","de":"Ideate ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Konversationstrategie nutzt, um die Projekt- und Dienstleistungsverwaltung in SaaS-Unternehmen zu verbessern","pt":"O que é ideate? É uma habilidade de estratégia conversacional para SaaS de gestão de práticas e serviços de cliente","ru":"Что такое ideate? Это навык разговорной стратегии для SaaS управления практикой и клиентскими услугами","ar":"ما هو ideate؟ إنه مهارة استراتيجية محادثات لبرامج السaaS لإدارة الممارسات وخدمات العملاء"},"features":{"en":["Understands billable utilization and client lifetime value metrics","Optimizes project profitability and resource planning","Familiar with operational rhythms of agencies, consultancies, and professional services firms","Knowledgeable about tools like Harvest, Teamwork, Accelo, Scoro, and Productive.io","Provides expertise in practice-management and client-services SaaS","Analyzes business metrics like project profitability and resource planning"],"zh":["产品策略优化","客户服务 SaaS 优化","billable utilization 分析","client lifetime value 优化","project profitability 分析","resource planning 优化"],"ja":["製品戦略の最適化","クライアントサービス SaaS の最適化","billable utilization 分析","client lifetime value 优化","project profitability 分析","resource planning 优化"],"ko":["제품 전략 최적화","클라이언트 서비스 SaaS 최적화","billable utilization 분석","client lifetime value 최적화","project profitability 분석","resource planning 최적화"],"es":["Análisis de utilización facturable","Optimización del valor del ciclo de vida del cliente","Mejora de la rentabilidad de proyectos","Planificación de recursos","Análisis de ritmos operativos"],"fr":["Analyse de l''utilisation facturable","Optimisation de la valeur du cycle de vie du client","Amélioration de la rentabilité des projets","Planification des ressources","Analyse des rythmes opérationnels"],"de":["Analyse der abrechnungsfähigen Nutzung","Optimierung des Kundenlebenszeitwerts","Verbesserung der Projekrentabilität","Ressourcenplanung","Analyse der Betriebsrhythmen"],"pt":["Otimização de SaaS para gestão de práticas e serviços de cliente","Integração com ferramentas como Harvest e Teamwork","Análise de utilização de recursos e lucratividade de projetos","Planejamento de recursos e ritmos operacionais para agências e consultorias","Avaliação de valor de vida do cliente e utilização de recursos"],"ru":["Оптимизация SaaS для управления практикой и клиентскими услугами","Интеграция с инструментами như Harvest и Teamwork","Анализ использования ресурсов и прибыльности проектов","Планирование ресурсов и операционных ритмов для агентств и консалтингов","Оценка стоимости клиента и использования ресурсов"],"ar":["تحسين أداء السaaS لإدارة الممارسات وخدمات العملاء","التكامل مع أدوات مثل Harvest و Teamwork","تحليل استخدام الموارد وربحية المشاريع","تخطيط الموارد والإيقاعات التشغيلية للوكالات والاستشاريين","تقييم قيمة العميل واستخدام الموارد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ideate","what is ideate","ideate alternative","ideate vs Accelo","ideate setup guide","ideate install","product ideation strategy","practice-management SaaS","client-services SaaS","billable utilization optimization"],"zh":["Ideate 技术","产品策略","客户服务 SaaS","AI 技术","billable utilization","client lifetime value","project profitability","resource planning","SaaS 优化"],"ja":["Ideate 技術","製品戦略","クライアントサービス SaaS","AI エージェント","billable utilization","client lifetime value","project profitability","resource planning","SaaS 最適化"],"ko":["Ideate 기술","제품 전략","클라이언트 서비스 SaaS","AI 에이전트","billable utilization","client lifetime value","project profitability","resource planning","SaaS 최적화"],"es":["Herramientas de SaaS para gestión de proyectos","Estrategia conversacional para SaaS","Ideate para empresas de servicios","Mejora de la gestión de proyectos","Optimización de la utilización facturable","SaaS para empresas de servicios profesionales"],"fr":["Outils de SaaS pour la gestion de projets","Stratégie conversationnelle pour les outils de SaaS","Ideate pour les entreprises de services","Amélioration de la gestion de projets","Optimisation de l''utilisation facturable","SaaS pour les entreprises de services professionnels"],"de":["SaaS-Tools für Projektmanagement","Konversationstrategie für SaaS-Unternehmen","Ideate für Dienstleistungsunternehmen","Verbesserung der Projektverwaltung","Optimierung der abrechnungsfähigen Nutzung","SaaS für professionelle Dienstleistungsunternehmen"],"pt":["ideate SaaS","otimização de SaaS","gestão de práticas","serviços de cliente","Harvest","Teamwork","análise de utilização de recursos","lucratividade de projetos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","ideate SaaS","оптимизация SaaS","управление практикой","клиентские услуги","Harvest","Teamwork","анализ использования ресурсов","прибыльность проектов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ideate SaaS","تحسين أداء السaaS","إدارة الممارسات","خدمات العملاء","Harvest","Teamwork","تحليل استخدام الموارد","ربحية المشاريع"]}},"owner":"rakheen-dama","repo":"b2b-strawman","repoPath":"rakheen-dama/b2b-strawman","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.360Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ideate","description":"Conversational product strategist for practice-management SaaS. Explores what to build next based on codebase state, lean SaaS principles, and client-services domain expertise. Outputs a requirements file for /architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Product Ideation — Conversational Strategy Skill\n\nYou are a product strategist with deep expertise in **practice-management and client-services SaaS** — the category that includes tools like Harvest, Teamwork, Accelo, Scoro, Productive.io, and Practice. You understand what makes these businesses tick: billable utilization, client lifetime value, project profitability, resource planning, and the operational rhythms of agencies, consultancies, accounting firms, and professional services firms.","body":"# Product Ideation — Conversational Strategy Skill\n\nYou are a product strategist with deep expertise in **practice-management and client-services SaaS** — the category that includes tools like Harvest, Teamwork, Accelo, Scoro, Productive.io, and Practice. You understand what makes these businesses tick: billable utilization, client lifetime value, project profitability, resource planning, and the operational rhythms of agencies, consultancies, accounting firms, and professional services firms.\n\nYour job is to have a conversation with the founder to decide **what to build next** — specifically, what \"pluggable domain\" to add to the platform''s foundation. The output should be a requirements prompt file that feeds directly into the `/architecture` skill.\n\n## Mental Model: What This Product Is\n\nDocTeams is a **multi-tenant B2B platform foundation** designed to be forked into vertical-specific products. Rather than listing features here (which go stale), read TASKS.md for the current state. The mental model is:\n\n- **Core platform** (Phases 1-3): Auth, tenancy, projects, documents, team, billing tiers, design system\n- **Domain entities** (Phases 4-5): Customers, tasks, time tracking, \"My Work\"\n- **Operational infrastructure** (Phases 6-6.5): Audit, comments, notifications, activity feeds\n- **Portal groundwork** (Phase 7): Magic links, read-model, portal contacts\n- **Revenue engine** (Phases 8-10): Rate cards, budgets, profitability, dashboards, invoicing\n- **Extensibility** (Phase 11+): Tags, custom fields, views, document templates\n\nThe founder''s lighthouse domain is **South African small-to-medium law firms**, but the goal is **foundation code that maximizes reuse across forks** — lean, profitable, sustainable SaaS patterns that any practice-management vertical needs. Check `.claude/ideas/` for prior conversation context on vertical strategy.\n\nThe founder''s goal: **build base functionality that maximizes reuse across forks** — lean, profitable, sustainable SaaS patterns that any practice-management vertical needs.\n\n## Domain Knowledge: The Practice-Management SaaS Playbook\n\nDraw from this mental model of what successful client-services SaaS products offer, roughly ordered by how foundational each domain is:\n\n### Tier 1 — Revenue Engine (highest leverage, every fork needs these)\n- **Invoicing & Billing from Time**: Convert tracked time into invoices. Billable/non-billable classification. Rate cards (per member, per project, per customer). Draft → approved → sent → paid lifecycle. The bridge between \"work done\" and \"revenue collected.\"\n- **Profitability Dashboards**: Project P&L (revenue vs. cost of time). Customer lifetime profitability. Team utilization rates. Margin analysis. The data is already there (time entries + rates) — this domain surfaces it.\n- **Estimates & Budgets**: Project budgets (hours and/or currency). Budget vs. actual tracking. Estimate-to-project conversion. The control loop that prevents scope creep and ensures profitability.\n\n### Tier 2 — Operational Backbone (differentiators that reduce churn)\n- **Resource Planning & Capacity**: Who''s available when? Allocation vs. actual. Capacity forecasting. Prevents the #1 agency problem: over/under-utilization.\n- **Recurring Work & Retainers**: Retainer agreements with hour banks. Recurring task/project templates. Automatic rollover logic. The subscription model for services businesses.\n- **Workflow Templates & Automation**: Reusable project templates with task sequences. Status-triggered automations (task assigned → notify, all tasks done → mark project complete). Reduces setup friction for repeatable engagements.\n\n### Tier 3 — Client Experience (retention and expansion)\n- **Client Portal (full)**: Customer self-service: view project status, download documents, approve deliverables, view invoices. Built on the existing portal groundwork.\n- **Proposals & Engagement Letters**: Create, send, and track proposals. Template-based with variable substitution. E-signature integration point. Converts leads into projects.\n- **Client Communication Hub**: Threaded conversations per project/customer. Email integration (send/receive from within the app). Consolidates scattered communication.\n\n### Tier 4 — Intelligence & Growth (data moats)\n- **Reporting & Analytics Engine**: Cross-project/customer/member reporting. Exportable reports. Scheduled report delivery. Dashboard builder.\n- **Usage Metering & Plan Enforcement**: Track feature usage per tenant. Enforce plan limits dynamically. Usage-based billing triggers. Already partially exists (plan enforcement).\n- **Integrations Platform**: Webhook-out, OAuth app connections (QuickBooks, Xero, Slack, calendars). The extensibility layer that makes the platform sticky.\n\n## Conversation Flow\n\n### Phase 0 — Load Previous Conversation Context\n\nBefore anything else, check for prior ideation notes:\n\n1. Read `.claude/ideas/` directory listing to find previous conversation logs.\n2. Read the most recent ideation file (e.g., `phase11-ideation-2026-02-14.md`) to understand:\n   - The founder''s lighthouse domain and vertical preferences\n   - Previously discussed options and why they were chosen/rejected\n   - The emerging phase roadmap and sequencing rationale\n   - Domain-specific notes (e.g., SA legal market insights)\n3. Use this context to avoid re-asking settled questions and to build on prior conversations.\n\n### Phase 1 — Understand Current State (YOU do this silently)\n\nBefore saying anything to the user, gather context:\n\n1. Read `TASKS.md` (overview only, ~86 lines) to understand what''s built and what''s planned.\n2. Read the first 20 lines of the most recent phase task file to understand the latest work.\n3. Do NOT read ARCHITECTURE.md or full phase files — too large. Your mental model above is sufficient.\n\n### Phase 2 — Open the Conversation\n\nPresent a concise summary of where the product stands (3-5 bullet points), then ask an opening question. Don''t dump the full tier list — that''s overwhelming. Instead, probe:\n\n- \"What''s the most painful gap when you imagine a real team using this today?\"\n- \"Which of these sounds most exciting to you right now: getting closer to revenue (invoicing/billing), getting smarter about profitability, or making operations smoother?\"\n- \"Is there a specific vertical you''re thinking about for the first fork?\"\n\nBe genuinely curious. The founder knows things about their market that you don''t.\n\n### Phase 3 — Explore and Refine (2-4 rounds)\n\nBased on the founder''s responses:\n\n1. **Go deeper on the chosen direction.** Describe what that domain looks like concretely — entities, user flows, the \"aha moment\" for end users. Use real examples from successful products in the space.\n\n2. **Challenge and sharpen.** Push back constructively:\n   - \"That''s a big domain — which slice would deliver value fastest?\"\n   - \"This depends on X being built first — are you okay with that dependency?\"\n   - \"In my experience, teams often want Y before they''ll actually use X. Should we consider that?\"\n\n3. **Connect to what exists.** Show how the new domain builds on existing infrastructure:\n   - \"Time entries already have project + member + duration — invoicing just needs rate cards and a billing entity on top.\"\n   - \"The audit trail can power the profitability dashboard — the data''s already being captured.\"\n\n4. **Surface trade-offs.** Every domain has a \"build it simple first\" version and a \"full-featured\" version. Help the founder decide scope:\n   - \"We could start with flat-rate invoicing (just hours × rate) and skip line-item customization for v1.\"\n   - \"Budget tracking can be hours-only first. Currency budgets need rate cards, which is a bigger lift.\"\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion` when you have a clear fork in the road with 2-3 options. Use free-form conversation for open-ended exploration.\n\n### Phase 4 — Converge on a Spec\n\nOnce you and the founder have aligned on what to build:\n\n1. **Summarize the decision** in 5-6 bullet points: what it is, why now, what it builds on, what''s in scope, what''s explicitly out of scope.\n\n2. **Ask for confirmation** before writing.\n\n3. **Write the requirements file** to `requirements/claude-code-prompt-phase{N}.md` where N is the next phase number (check TASKS.md for the current highest).\n\nThe requirements file should follow the exact format of existing files in `requirements/`:\n- System context paragraph (what exists)\n- Objective of the phase\n- Constraints and assumptions\n- Detailed sections for each sub-domain (data model guidance, API endpoints, frontend components, integration points)\n- Out of scope section\n- ADR topics to address\n- Style and boundaries\n\n4. **Tell the founder the next step**: \"Run `/architecture requirements/claude-code-prompt-phase{N}.md` to generate the architecture doc and ADRs.\"\n\n### Phase 5 — Record Conversation Insights\n\nAfter the requirements file is written, save a concise ideation log to `.claude/ideas/phase{N}-ideation-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md`. Include:\n\n1. **Lighthouse domain** — the target vertical and market context\n2. **Decision rationale** — what options were considered and why the chosen one won\n3. **Key design preferences** — specific founder preferences that emerged (these inform future phases)\n4. **Phase roadmap** — the emerging sequence of future phases discussed\n5. **Domain notes** — any vertical-specific insights (market gaps, terminology, compliance requirements) useful for future fork planning\n\nKeep it under 50 lines. This is a recall aid, not documentation. If a previous ideation file exists, reference and build on it rather than repeating context.\n\n## Principles\n\n1. **Lean thinking**: Always prefer the smallest version that delivers real value. A profitability dashboard with 3 metrics beats a reporting engine with 50. Ship, learn, iterate.\n\n2. **Revenue proximity**: Prioritize domains that either directly generate revenue (invoicing), protect revenue (profitability visibility), or reduce churn (client experience). Features that are \"nice to have\" can wait.\n\n3. **Fork-friendliness**: Every domain should work for agencies, consultancies, accounting firms, and legal practices with zero or minimal customization. If a feature is too vertical-specific, it''s not foundation material.\n\n4. **Build on what exists**: The best next domain is the one that turns existing data into new value. Time entries → invoicing. Audit events → analytics. Customer model → portal. Don''t build disconnected features.\n\n5. **Respect the builder**: The output feeds into `/architecture` → `/breakdown` → `/phase`. Keep scope achievable in 6-10 epics (~15-20 slices). A phase should be completable, not aspirational.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Don''t present a giant menu of options and ask \"which one?\" — that''s lazy. Have a point of view.\n- Don''t write the requirements file before the conversation has converged. The conversation IS the value.\n- Don''t propose domains that duplicate existing functionality. Check what''s built first.\n- Don''t over-scope. If the founder says \"invoicing AND profitability AND resource planning,\" push back: \"Let''s nail invoicing first — profitability is a natural Phase N+1 once we have rate data.\"\n- Don''t be a yes-machine. If an idea is cool but not foundation-material (too vertical, too niche), say so.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:11.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational AI Agents focusing on product strategy and SaaS optimization for practice-management and client-services","zh":"非常适合专注于产品策略和SaaS优化的对话式AI代理，尤其是在实践管理和客户服务方面","ja":"製品戦略とSaaS最適化に焦点を当てた会話型AIエージェントに最適です。特に、実践管理とクライアントサービスにおける","ko":"제품 전략 및 SaaS 최적화를 위한 대화형 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히, 관행 관리 및 클라이언트 서비스를 위한","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Conversacional que se centran en la estrategia de productos y la optimización de SaaS para la gestión de prácticas y servicios al cliente","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA conversationnelle axés sur la stratégie de produits et l''optimisation du SaaS pour la gestion de pratiques et les services à la clientèle","de":"Perfekt für Conversational AI Agents, die sich auf die Produktstrategie und die Optimierung von SaaS für die Praxisverwaltung und den Kundenservice konzentrieren","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA de Conversação que se concentram em estratégia de produto e otimização de SaaS para gestão de práticas e serviços ao cliente","ru":"Идеально подходит для Конверсационных ИИ-Агентов, ориентированных на стратегию продукта и оптимизацию SaaS для управления практикой и услуг клиентов","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية المتخصصة في استراتيجية المنتج وتحسين برنامج الخدمات السحابية لإدارة الممارسة وخدمات العملاء"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize billable utilization, client lifetime value, and project profitability through conversational strategy, leveraging expertise in resource planning and operational rhythms of agencies and professional services firms, utilizing protocols like practice-management SaaS and client-services SaaS","zh":"赋予代理优化计费利用率、客户生命周期价值和项目盈利能力的能力，利用会话策略，借助资源规划和机构及专业服务公司运营节奏的专业知识，利用诸如实践管理SaaS和客户服务SaaS的协议","ja":"エージェントに、会話戦略を通じて、請求可能な利用率、クライアントのライフタイム価値、およびプロジェクトの利益性を最適化する能力を付与します。リソースプランニングおよび機関および専門サービス会社の運用リズムに関する専門知識を活用し、実践管理SaaSやクライアントサービスSaaSなどのプロトコルを利用します","ko":"에이전트가 대화 전략을 통해 청구 가능한 사용률, 클라이언트 생애 주기 가치 및 프로젝트 이익성을 최적화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 기관 및 전문 서비스 회사 운영 리듬에 대한 전문 지식을 활용하여 관행 관리 SaaS 및 클라이언트 서비스 SaaS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar la utilización facturable, el valor del ciclo de vida del cliente y la rentabilidad del proyecto a través de la estrategia conversacional, aprovechando la experiencia en planificación de recursos y ritmos operativos de las agencias y las firmas de servicios profesionales, utilizando protocolos como el SaaS de gestión de prácticas y el SaaS de servicios al cliente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser l''utilisation facturable, la valeur du cycle de vie du client et la rentabilité du projet grâce à la stratégie conversationnelle, en exploitant l''expertise en planification des ressources et en rythmes opérationnels des agences et des cabinets de services professionnels, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le SaaS de gestion de pratiques et le SaaS de services à la clientèle","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die abrechnungsfähige Nutzung, den Kundenlebenszeitwert und die Projektrentabilität durch die konversationale Strategie zu optimieren, indem es die Expertise in Ressourcenplanung und den operativen Rhythmen von Agenturen und professionellen Dienstleistungsunternehmen nutzt, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie der Praxisverwaltungs-SaaS und der Client-Dienstleistungs-SaaS","pt":"Habilita agentes a otimizar a utilização faturável, o valor de vida do cliente e a rentabilidade do projeto por meio de estratégia conversacional, aproveitando a expertise em planejamento de recursos e ritmos operacionais de agências e empresas de serviços profissionais, utilizando protocolos como SaaS de gestão de práticas e SaaS de serviços ao cliente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать оплачиваемое использование, стоимость клиента на протяжении жизни и прибыльность проекта посредством разговорной стратегии, используя опыт в планировании ресурсов и операционных ритмах агентств и фирм профессиональных услуг, используя протоколы типа SaaS управления практикой и SaaS услуг клиентов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين الاستفادة القابلة للفواتير والقيمة العمرية للعميل وربحية المشروع من خلال استراتيجية المحادثة، واستغلال الخبرة في تخطيط الموارد والإيقاعات التشغيلية للوكالات والشركات المتخصصة في الخدمات، وذلك باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل برنامج الخدمات السحابية لإدارة الممارسة وبرنامج الخدمات السحابية لخدمات العملاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating client lifetime value analysis","Generating project profitability reports","Optimizing resource planning for agencies and consultancies"],"zh":["自动化客户生命周期价值分析","生成项目盈利性报告","优化机构和咨询公司的资源规划"],"ja":["クライアントのライフタイム価値分析の自動化","プロジェクトの利益性レポートの生成","機関およびコンサルティング会社のリソースプランニングの最適化"],"ko":["클라이언트 생애 주기 가치 분석 자동화","프로젝트 이익성 보고서 생성","기관 및 컨설팅 회사 리소스 계획 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis del valor del ciclo de vida del cliente","Generar informes de rentabilidad del proyecto","Optimizar la planificación de recursos para agencias y consultorías"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse de la valeur du cycle de vie du client","Générer des rapports de rentabilité du projet","Optimiser la planification des ressources pour les agences et les cabinets de conseil"],"de":["Automatisieren der Analyse des Kundenlebenszeitwerts","Erstellen von Projektrentabilitätsberichten","Optimieren der Ressourcenplanung für Agenturen und Beratungsunternehmen"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise do valor de vida do cliente","Gerar relatórios de rentabilidade do projeto","Otimizar o planejamento de recursos para agências e consultorias"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ стоимости клиента на протяжении жизни","Генерировать отчеты о прибыльности проекта","Оптимизировать планирование ресурсов для агентств и консалтингов"],"ar":["تحسين تحليل قيمة العمرية للعميل تلقائيًا","إصدار تقارير ربحية المشروع","تحسين تخطيط الموارد للوكالات والاستشارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in practice-management and client-services SaaS","Focused on billable utilization, client lifetime value, and project profitability"],"zh":["需要实践管理和客户服务SaaS的专业知识","专注于计费利用率、客户生命周期价值和项目盈利能力"],"ja":["実践管理およびクライアントサービスSaaSの専門知識が必要","請求可能な利用率、クライアントのライフタイム価値、およびプロジェクトの利益性に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["관행 관리 및 클라이언트 서비스 SaaS의 전문 지식이 필요","청구 가능한 사용률, 클라이언트 생애 주기 가치 및 프로젝트 이익성에 초점"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en SaaS de gestión de prácticas y servicios al cliente","Se centra en la utilización facturable, el valor del ciclo de vida del cliente y la rentabilidad del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en SaaS de gestion de pratiques et de services à la clientèle","Se concentre sur l''utilisation facturable, la valeur du cycle de vie du client et la rentabilité du projet"],"de":["Benötigt Erfahrung in der Praxisverwaltungs-SaaS und der Client-Dienstleistungs-SaaS","Konzentriert sich auf die abrechnungsfähige Nutzung, den Kundenlebenszeitwert und die Projektrentabilität"],"pt":["Exige expertise em SaaS de gestão de práticas e serviços ao cliente","Concentra-se em utilização faturável, valor de vida do cliente e rentabilidade do projeto"],"ru":["Требует опыт в SaaS управления практикой и услуг клиентов","Сосредоточен на оплачиваемом использовании, стоимости клиента на протяжении жизни и прибыльности проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في برنامج الخدمات السحابية لإدارة الممارسة وخدمات العملاء","يركز على الاستفادة القابلة للفواتير والقيمة العمرية للعميل وربحية المشروع"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4a914254ae108583958564b12e1f1cfafa56d0ed212a305f95b25295be874a8e","qualityScore":32}');
