pour la chaîne d''outils mise, fnox et infisical","de":"devtools-secrets ist ein Satz von Kenntnissen und Schutzmechanismen für die Werkzeugkette mise, fnox und infisical","pt":"O que é DevTools Secrets? É uma ferramenta de configuração para mise, fnox e infisical","ru":"Что такое DevTools Secrets? Это инструмент конфигурации для mise, fnox и infisical","ar":"ما هي أدوات التطوير السرية؟ هي أداة إعدادات لميس و fnx و infisical"},"features":{"en":["Validates tool availability using command -v mise and command -v fnox","Checks installation status of mise and fnox using curl and sh","Provides version information for mise and fnox using --version flags","Supports installation of mise using curl https://mise.run | sh","Offers guidance on using the infisical secrets toolchain","Includes guardrails for the mise, fnox, and infisical secrets toolchain"],"zh":["支持 mise 和 fnox 工具链","提供工具链验证功能","支持命令行接口（CLI）","包含 mise 和 fnox 的版本检查","提供安装指南"],"ja":["mise と fnox ツールチェーンをサポート","ツールチェーンの検証機能を提供","コマンドラインインターフェース（CLI）をサポート","mise と fnox のバージョンチェックを含む","インストールガイドを提供"],"ko":["mise 및 fnox 툴체인을 지원","툴체인 검증 기능을 제공","명령줄 인터페이스（CLI）를 지원","mise 및 fnox의 버전 확인을 포함","설치 가이드를 제공"],"es":["Validación de la cadena de herramientas mise, fnox e infisical","Comprobación de la instalación de mise y fnox","Soporte para la configuración de Claude Code","Integración con infisical para un desarrollo más eficiente","Uso de comandos CLI para una configuración más flexible"],"fr":["Validation de la chaîne d''outils mise, fnox et infisical","Vérification de l''installation de mise et fnox","Support pour la configuration de Claude Code","Intégration avec infisical pour un développement plus efficace","Utilisation de commandes CLI pour une configuration plus flexible"],"de":["Validierung der Werkzeugkette mise, fnox und infisical","Überprüfung der Installation von mise und fnox","Unterstützung für die Konfiguration von Claude Code","Integration mit infisical für eine effizientere Entwicklung","Verwendung von CLI-Befehlen für eine flexiblere Konfiguration"],"pt":["Configuração de mise para melhorar a produtividade","Integração com fnox para automação de tarefas","Suporte a infisical para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Validação de ferramentas para garantir a compatibilidade","Instalação fácil com curl e sh"],"ru":["Настройка mise для повышения производительности","Интеграция с fnox для автоматизации задач","Поддержка infisical для разработки приложений","Валидация инструментов для обеспечения совместимости","Легкая установка с помощью curl и sh"],"ar":["إعدادات لميس لتحسين الإنتاجية","التكامل مع fnx لتوفير مهام","دعم infisical لتنمية التطبيقات","التحقق من أدوات لضمان التوافق","التثبيت السهل مع curl و sh"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use devtools-secrets","devtools-secrets setup guide","devtools-secrets vs mise","devtools-secrets install","what is devtools-secrets","devtools-secrets alternative","mise and fnox toolchain","infisical secrets management","devtools-secrets configuration"],"zh":["DevTools Secrets","mise 工具链","fnox 工具链","工具链验证","CLI","技术库","AIエージェント","设置指南"],"ja":["DevTools Secrets","mise ツールチェーン","fnox ツールチェーン","ツールチェーンの検証","CLI","技術ライブラリ","AIエージェント","セットアップガイド"],"ko":["DevTools Secrets","mise 툴체인","fnox 툴체인","툴체인 검증","CLI","기술 라이브러리","AI 에이전트","설정 가이드"],"es":["devtools-secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","configuración de desarrollo","cadena de herramientas","desarrollo de software","productividad de desarrolladores","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["devtools-secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","configuration de développement","chaîne d''outils","développement de logiciels","productivité des développeurs","outils de développement"],"de":["devtools-secrets","mise","fnox","infisical","Entwicklungskonfiguration","Werkzeugkette","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklerproduktivität","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["DevTools Secrets","mise configuração","fnox automação","infisical desenvolvimento","produtividade desenvolvedor","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","configuração de mise","integração com fnox"],"ru":["DevTools Secrets","mise настройка","fnox автоматизация","infisical разработка","производительность разработчика","инструменты разработки","настройка mise","интеграция с fnox"],"ar":["أدوات التطوير السرية","إعدادات لميس","fnx توفير","infisical تطبيق","إنتاجية المطور","أدوات التطوير","إعدادات لميس","التكامل مع fnx"]}},"owner":"basher83","repo":"lunar-claude","repoPath":"basher83/lunar-claude","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devtools-secrets","description":">","bodyPreview":"# DevTools Secrets\n\nKnowledge and guardrails for the **mise + fnox + infisical** secrets toolchain.\n\n## Toolchain Validation\n\n**IMPORTANT: Check tool availability before proceeding with any guidance.**\n\n- mise: !`command -v mise >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(mise --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: curl https://mise.run | sh\"`\n- fnox: !`command -v fnox >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(fnox --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install","body":"# DevTools Secrets\n\nKnowledge and guardrails for the **mise + fnox + infisical** secrets toolchain.\n\n## Toolchain Validation\n\n**IMPORTANT: Check tool availability before proceeding with any guidance.**\n\n- mise: !`command -v mise >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(mise --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: curl https://mise.run | sh\"`\n- fnox: !`command -v fnox >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(fnox --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: mise use -g fnox\"`\n- infisical: !`command -v infisical >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"INSTALLED ($(infisical --version 2>/dev/null | head -1))\" || echo \"MISSING — install with: mise use -g infisical\"`\n\nIf any tool above shows **MISSING**, stop and help the user install it before\nproceeding. Do not provide configuration guidance for tools that aren''t\ninstalled.\n\n## Project Config State\n\n- fnox.toml: !`test -f fnox.toml && echo \"YES\" || echo \"NO (run: fnox init)\"`\n- .infisical.json: !`test -f .infisical.json && cat .infisical.json || echo \"NO (run: infisical init)\"`\n- mise.toml env section: !`grep -A5 ''^\\[env\\]'' mise.toml 2>/dev/null || echo \"No env section\"`\n\n## System/Global Config\n\n- mise global config: !`test -f ~/.config/mise/config.toml && head -10 ~/.config/mise/config.toml || echo \"No global mise config\"`\n- fnox global config: !`test -f ~/.config/fnox/config.toml && head -10 ~/.config/fnox/config.toml || echo \"No global fnox config\"`\n- infisical logged in: !`infisical user get 2>/dev/null | head -3 || echo \"Not logged in or not installed\"`\n\n## Tool Roles\n\n| Tool | Role |\n|------|------|\n| **mise** | Task runner + env manager. Orchestrates dev tooling, runs tasks, manages env vars through plugins. |\n| **fnox** | Unified secret interface. Abstracts over multiple secret backends (infisical, age, env files) with a single CLI. |\n| **infisical** | Remote secrets backend. Stores, syncs, and injects secrets from a central server. |\n\nThese tools complement each other: infisical stores secrets remotely, fnox\nprovides a unified local interface to them, and mise orchestrates tasks that\nconsume secrets via fnox.\n\n## Integration Chain\n\nThe typical flow:\n\n1. **fnox.toml** defines infisical as a provider with project/environment config\n2. **`fnox exec --`** resolves secrets from the provider and injects them as env vars\n3. **mise tasks** can wrap `fnox exec` to run commands with secrets injected\n4. Alternatively, **mise env plugins** can call fnox directly for auto-injection on `cd`\n\n## Secrets Enforcement\n\nThis project enforces secrets hygiene via **always-on hooks** in\n`.claude/settings.json` (not scoped to this skill):\n\n- **`block-hardcoded-secrets.py`** — Blocks Edit/Write operations containing\n  hardcoded API keys, tokens, passwords, or known secret prefixes (sk-, ghp_,\n  AKIA, xox[bpras]-)\n- **`block-bare-secret-exports.py`** — Blocks Bash commands that `export`\n  secret-like env vars without wrapping in `fnox exec` or `infisical run`\n\nThese hooks are always active regardless of whether this skill is loaded.\n\n## Configuration Patterns\n\nDetailed configuration for each tool is in the reference files:\n\n- @references/mise-integration.md — mise env plugins, tasks, fnox integration\n- @references/fnox-configuration.md — fnox.toml structure, providers, profiles\n- @references/infisical-patterns.md — infisical CLI, scanning, CI/CD\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- **Order matters**: fnox.toml must exist before `fnox exec` works. Run\n  `fnox init` if missing.\n- **Profile mismatches**: fnox profiles (dev/staging/prod) must match infisical\n  environment slugs. A mismatch silently returns empty secrets.\n- **`.infisical.json` is safe to commit** — it contains project IDs and\n  workspace config, not secrets.\n- **`fnox.toml` may contain sensitive paths** — review before committing if\n  using age-encrypted file provider.\n- **mise env plugins run on `cd`** — if a plugin calls fnox and fnox is\n  misconfigured, you get errors on every directory change.\n- **infisical auth expires** — `infisical login` tokens have a TTL. CI/CD\n  should use `INFISICAL_TOKEN` (service token) instead.\n- **Token path scope is explicit** — a service token scoped to `/` cannot\n  access secrets in child paths like `/git_actions`. Each path requires its\n  own token or use `--recursive` with the CLI directly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:04.859Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents requiring secure secrets management with mise, fnox, and infisical toolchains.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 mise, fnox 和 infisical 工具链进行安全密钥管理的开发代理。","ja":"mise, fnox, および infisical ツールチェーンを使用したセキュアなシークレット管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"mise, fnox 및 infisical 툴체인을 사용한 보안 시크릿 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión de secretos segura con mise, fnox y toolchains de infisical.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de secrets sécurisée avec mise, fnox et les chaînes d''outils infisical.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine sichere Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mit mise, fnox und infisical-Toolchains erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de segredos seguro com mise, fnox e infisical toolchains.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих безопасного управления секретами с помощью mise, fnox и infisical toolchains.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون إدارة أمان للأسرار مع mise، fnox، و infisical toolchains."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage sensitive data securely using the mise, fnox, and infisical secrets toolchain, providing knowledge and guardrails for robust secret management, including validation of tool availability and version checking.","zh":"赋予代理管理敏感数据的安全能力，使用 mise, fnox 和 infisical 秘密工具链，提供知识和防护栏以实现强大的密钥管理，包括工具可用性验证和版本检查。","ja":"mise, fnox, および infisical シークレッツ ツールチェーンを使用して、エージェントが機密データをセキュアに管理できるようにすることで、強力なシークレット管理を実現します。ツールの可用性の検証やバージョンチェックなど、知識とガードレールを提供します。","ko":"mise, fnox 및 infisical 시크릿 툴체인을 사용하여 에이전트가 민감한 데이터를 보안적으로 관리할 수 있도록 강력한 시크릿 관리를 제공하며, 툴의 가용성 검증 및 버전 확인과 같은 지식과 가드레일을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar datos sensibles de forma segura utilizando la cadena de herramientas de secretos mise, fnox e infisical, proporcionando conocimientos y barandillas para una gestión robusta de secretos, incluyendo la validación de la disponibilidad de herramientas y la comprobación de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des données sensibles de manière sécurisée en utilisant la chaîne d''outils de secrets mise, fnox et infisical, fournissant des connaissances et des garde-fous pour une gestion robuste des secrets, y compris la validation de la disponibilité des outils et la vérification des versions.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, sensible Daten sicher zu verwalten, indem sie die mise-, fnox- und infisical-Geheimnis-Toolchain verwenden, und bietet Wissen und Schutz für eine robuste Geheimnisverwaltung, einschließlich der Überprüfung der Tool-Verfügbarkeit und der Versionsprüfung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dados sensíveis de forma segura usando a cadeia de ferramentas de segredos mise, fnox e infisical, fornecendo conhecimento e guardrails para gerenciamento robusto de segredos, incluindo validação da disponibilidade de ferramentas e verificação de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять конфиденциальными данными безопасно с помощью цепочки инструментов для секретов mise, fnox и infisical, обеспечивая знания и ограничения для прочного управления секретами, включая проверку наличия инструментов и контроль версий.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إدارة البيانات الحساسة بشكل آمن باستخدام سلسلة أدوات الأسرار mise، fnox و infisical، وتوفير المعرفة والحماية لتدبير قوي للأسرار، بما في ذلك التحقق من توافر الأدوات ومراقبة الإصدارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mise, fnox, and infisical toolchain installations","Managing sensitive secrets with the infisical tool","Debugging mise and fnox integration issues"],"zh":["验证 mise, fnox 和 infisical 工具链安装","使用 infisical 工具管理敏感密钥","调试 mise 和 fnox 集成问题"],"ja":["mise, fnox, および infisical ツールチェーンのインストールを検証する","infisical ツールを使用して機密シークレットを管理する","mise と fnox の統合問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["mise, fnox 및 infisical 툴체인의 설치를 검증하는 것","infisical 툴을 사용하여 민감한 시크릿을 관리하는 것","mise 및 fnox의 통합 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Validar las instalaciones de la cadena de herramientas mise, fnox e infisical","Gestionar secretos sensibles con la herramienta infisical","Depurar problemas de integración de mise y fnox"],"fr":["Valider les installations de la chaîne d''outils mise, fnox et infisical","Gérer des secrets sensibles avec l''outil infisical","Déboguer les problèmes d''intégration de mise et fnox"],"de":["Überprüfen der Installationen der mise-, fnox- und infisical-Toolchain","Verwalten sensibler Geheimnisse mit dem infisical-Tool","Beheben von Integrationsproblemen von mise und fnox"],"pt":["Validar instalações da cadeia de ferramentas mise, fnox e infisical","Gerenciar segredos sensíveis com a ferramenta infisical","Depurar problemas de integração do mise e fnox"],"ru":["Проверка установки цепочки инструментов mise, fnox и infisical","Управление конфиденциальными секретами с помощью инструмента infisical","Отладка проблем интеграции mise и fnox"],"ar":["التحقق من تثبيت سلسلة أدوات mise، fnox و infisical","إدارة الأسرار الحساسة باستخدام أداة infisical","تصحيح مشاكل دمج mise و fnox"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mise, fnox, and infisical tools to be installed","Needs command-line access for tool validation"],"zh":["需要安装 mise, fnox 和 infisical 工具","需要命令行访问来验证工具"],"ja":["mise, fnox, および infisical ツールをインストールする必要がある","ツールの検証にはコマンドライン アクセスが必要"],"ko":["mise, fnox 및 infisical 툴을 설치해야 함","도구를 검증하려면 명령줄 액세스가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere que las herramientas mise, fnox e infisical estén instaladas","Necesita acceso a la línea de comandos para la validación de herramientas"],"fr":["Nécessite que les outils mise, fnox et infisical soient installés","Nécessite un accès en ligne de commande pour la validation des outils"],"de":["Erfordert, dass die Tools mise, fnox und infisical installiert sind","Benötigt eine Kommandozeilen-Zugriff für die Tool-Validierung"],"pt":["Exige que as ferramentas mise, fnox e infisical estejam instaladas","Necessita acesso à linha de comando para validação de ferramentas"],"ru":["Требует установки инструментов mise, fnox и infisical","Требует доступа к командной строке для проверки инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أدوات mise، fnox و infisical","يتطلب وصولاً إلى سطر الأوامر للتحقق من الأدوات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5971b4f9d8dceae1210d350f21fc8567bc8eb01c6d5da1f10cab8b4dd1e7e8d0","qualityScore":32}');
