iaires","Structure de code concise et technique"],"de":["Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen mit TypeScript","Verwendung von React Native und Expo zur Erstellung von mobilen Benutzeroberflächen","Funktionale und deklarative Programmierung mit Iterations- und Modularisierungsmustern","Verwendung von beschreibenden Variablen mit Hilfsverben","Konkise und technische Code-Struktur"],"pt":["Código conciso em TypeScript","Técnicas de programação funcionais e declarativas","Desenvolvimento de UI móvel com React Native e Expo","Uso de variáveis descritivas com verbos auxiliares","Modularização e iteração para evitar duplicação de código"],"ru":["Лаконичный код на TypeScript","Функциональные и декларативные шаблоны программирования","Разработка мобильных интерфейсов с помощью React Native и Expo","Использование описательных переменных с вспомогательными глаголами","Модуляризация и итерация для избежания дублирования кода"],"ar":["شفرة متوفرة في TypeScript","تقنيات برمجة وظيفية و إعلانية","تطوير واجهات المستخدم المتنقلة مع React Native و Expo","استخدام متغيرات وصفية مع أفعال مساعدة","التعديل و التكرار لتجنب تكرار الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pro","pro vs React Native","pro install guide","what is pro","pro alternative to Expo","pro setup for mobile UI development","pro and TypeScript development","pro expert level development"],"zh":["Pro AI Agent","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","移动 UI 开发","函数式编程","声明式编程","迭代和模块化"],"ja":["Pro AIエージェント","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","モバイル UI 開発","関数型プログラミング","宣言型プログラミング","イテレーションとモジュール化"],"ko":["Pro AI 에이전트","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","모바일 UI 개발","함수형 프로그래밍","선언형 프로그래밍","반복 및 모듈화"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","programación funcional","patrones de iteración","modularización","variables descriptivas","estructura de código concisa"],"fr":["développement d''applications mobiles","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","programmation fonctionnelle","modèles d''itération","modularisation","variables descriptives","structure de code concise"],"de":["Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","funktionale Programmierung","Iterationsmuster","Modularisierung","beschreibende Variablen","konkise Code-Struktur"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","UI móvel","programação funcional","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","tecnologias móveis"],"ru":["разработка мобильных приложений","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","мобильные интерфейсы","функциональное программирование","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","мобильные технологии","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","TypeScript","React Native","Expo","واجهات المستخدم المتنقلة","برمجة وظيفية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تقنيات المتنقلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"kdv1995","repo":"react-native-app","repoPath":"kdv1995/react-native-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.487Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pro","description":"This is a pro react native developer with expo native","bodyPreview":"# Overview\n\nInsert overview text here. The agent will only see this should they choose to apply the rule.\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript, React Native, Expo, and Mobile UI development.\n\nCode Style and Structure\n\n- Write concise, technical TypeScript code with accurate examples.\n- Use functional and declarative programming patterns; avoid classes.\n- Prefer iteration and modularization over code duplication.\n- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs (e.g., isLoading, hasError).\n- Str","body":"# Overview\n\nInsert overview text here. The agent will only see this should they choose to apply the rule.\n\nYou are an expert in TypeScript, React Native, Expo, and Mobile UI development.\n\nCode Style and Structure\n\n- Write concise, technical TypeScript code with accurate examples.\n- Use functional and declarative programming patterns; avoid classes.\n- Prefer iteration and modularization over code duplication.\n- Use descriptive variable names with auxiliary verbs (e.g., isLoading, hasError).\n- Structure files: exported component, subcomponents, helpers, static content, types.\n- Follow Expo''s official documentation for setting up and configuring your projects: https://docs.expo.dev/\n\nNaming Conventions\n\n- Use lowercase with dashes for directories (e.g., components/auth-wizard).\n- Favor named exports for components.\n\nTypeScript Usage\n\n- Use TypeScript for all code; prefer interfaces over types.\n- Avoid enums; use maps instead.\n- Use functional components with TypeScript interfaces.\n- Use strict mode in TypeScript for better type safety.\n\nSyntax and Formatting\n\n- Use the \"function\" keyword for pure functions.\n- Avoid unnecessary curly braces in conditionals; use concise syntax for simple statements.\n- Use declarative JSX.\n- Use Prettier for consistent code formatting.\n\nUI and Styling\n\n- Use Expo''s built-in components for common UI patterns and layouts.\n- Implement responsive design with Flexbox and Expo''s useWindowDimensions for screen size adjustments.\n- Use styled-components or Tailwind CSS for component styling.\n- Implement dark mode support using Expo''s useColorScheme.\n- Ensure high accessibility (a11y) standards using ARIA roles and native accessibility props.\n- Leverage react-native-reanimated and react-native-gesture-handler for performant animations and gestures.\n\nSafe Area Management\n\n- Use SafeAreaProvider from react-native-safe-area-context to manage safe areas globally in your app.\n- Wrap top-level components with SafeAreaView to handle notches, status bars, and other screen insets on both iOS and Android.\n- Use SafeAreaScrollView for scrollable content to ensure it respects safe area boundaries.\n- Avoid hardcoding padding or margins for safe areas; rely on SafeAreaView and context hooks.\n\nPerformance Optimization\n\n- Minimize the use of useState and useEffect; prefer context and reducers for state management.\n- Use Expo''s AppLoading and SplashScreen for optimized app startup experience.\n- Optimize images: use WebP format where supported, include size data, implement lazy loading with expo-image.\n- Implement code splitting and lazy loading for non-critical components with React''s Suspense and dynamic imports.\n- Profile and monitor performance using React Native''s built-in tools and Expo''s debugging features.\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders by memoizing components and using useMemo and useCallback hooks appropriately.\n\nNavigation\n\n- Use react-navigation for routing and navigation; follow its best practices for stack, tab, and drawer navigators.\n- Leverage deep linking and universal links for better user engagement and navigation flow.\n- Use dynamic routes with expo-router for better navigation handling.\n\nState Management\n\n- Use React Context and useReducer for managing global state.\n- Leverage react-query for data fetching and caching; avoid excessive API calls.\n- For complex state management, consider using Zustand or Redux Toolkit.\n- Handle URL search parameters using libraries like expo-linking.\n\nError Handling and Validation\n\n- Use Zod for runtime validation and error handling.\n- Implement proper error logging using Sentry or a similar service.\n- Prioritize error handling and edge cases:\n  - Handle errors at the beginning of functions.\n  - Use early returns for error conditions to avoid deeply nested if statements.\n  - Avoid unnecessary else statements; use if-return pattern instead.\n  - Implement global error boundaries to catch and handle unexpected errors.\n- Use expo-error-reporter for logging and reporting errors in production.\n\nTesting\n\n- Write unit tests using Jest and React Native Testing Library.\n- Implement integration tests for critical user flows using Detox.\n- Use Expo''s testing tools for running tests in different environments.\n- Consider snapshot testing for components to ensure UI consistency.\n\nSecurity\n\n- Sanitize user inputs to prevent XSS attacks.\n- Use react-native-encrypted-storage for secure storage of sensitive data.\n- Ensure secure communication with APIs using HTTPS and proper authentication.\n- Use Expo''s Security guidelines to protect your app: https://docs.expo.dev/guides/security/\n\nInternationalization (i18n)\n\n- Use react-native-i18n or expo-localization for internationalization and localization.\n- Support multiple languages and RTL layouts.\n- Ensure text scaling and font adjustments for accessibility.\n\nKey Conventions\n\n1. Rely on Expo''s managed workflow for streamlined development and deployment.\n2. Prioritize Mobile Web Vitals (Load Time, Jank, and Responsiveness).\n3. Use expo-constants for managing environment variables and configuration.\n4. Use expo-permissions to handle device permissions gracefully.\n5. Implement expo-updates for over-the-air (OTA) updates.\n6. Follow Expo''s best practices for app deployment and publishing: https://docs.expo.dev/distribution/introduction/\n7. Ensure compatibility with iOS and Android by testing extensively on both platforms.\n\nAPI Documentation\n\n- Use Expo''s official documentation for setting up and configuring your projects: https://docs.expo.dev/\n\nRefer to Expo''s documentation for detailed information on Views, Blueprints, and Extensions for best practices.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:06.228Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile UI Agents needing expertise in TypeScript, React Native, and Expo for high-quality application development.","zh":"非常适合需要在TypeScript、React Native和Expo方面具有专业知识的移动UI代理，用于开发高质量的应用程序。","ja":"TypeScript、React Native、Expoの専門知識が必要なモバイルUIエージェントに最適で、高品質のアプリケーション開発に役立ちます。","ko":"TypeScript, React Native, Expo에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 모바일 UI 에이전트에게 적합하여 고품질의 애플리케이션 개발에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de UI Móvil que necesitan experiencia en TypeScript, React Native y Expo para el desarrollo de aplicaciones de alta calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''interface utilisateur mobile nécessitant une expertise en TypeScript, React Native et Expo pour le développement d''applications de haute qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile UI-Agents, die Expertenwissen in TypeScript, React Native und Expo für die Entwicklung von High-Quality-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI Móvel que necessitam de especialização em TypeScript, React Native e Expo para desenvolvimento de aplicações de alta qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов UI, которым необходимы знания в области TypeScript, React Native и Expo для разработки высококачественных приложений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في TypeScript و React Native و Expo من أجل تطوير تطبيقات عالية الجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop concise and technical mobile UI applications using TypeScript, React Native, and Expo, leveraging functional and declarative programming patterns for modular and efficient code.","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用TypeScript、React Native和Expo开发简洁和技术性的移动UI应用程序的能力，利用函数式和声明式编程模式实现模块化和高效的代码。","ja":"TypeScript、React Native、Expoを使用して、機能的および宣言的プログラミングパターンを利用してモジュラーで効率的なコードを実現する、簡潔で技術的なモバイルUIアプリケーションを開発するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"TypeScript, React Native, Expo를 사용하여 함수형 및 선언적 프로그래밍 패턴을 활용하여 모듈화되고 효율적인 코드를 달성하는 간결하고 기술적인 모바일 UI 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones de interfaz de usuario móvil concisas y técnicas utilizando TypeScript, React Native y Expo, aprovechando patrones de programación funcionales y declarativos para un código modular y eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications d''interface utilisateur mobile concises et techniques en utilisant TypeScript, React Native et Expo, en exploitant les modèles de programmation fonctionnelle et déclarative pour un code modulaire et efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile UI-Anwendungen zu entwickeln, die präzise und technisch sind, indem sie TypeScript, React Native und Expo verwenden, um funktionalen und deklarativen Programmiermustern für modularen und effizienten Code zu nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam aplicações de UI móvel concisas e técnicas usando TypeScript, React Native e Expo, aproveitando padrões de programação funcionais e declarativos para código modular e eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать краткие и технические мобильные приложения UI, используя TypeScript, React Native и Expo, используя функциональные и декларативные шаблоны программирования для модульного и эффективного кода.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم المحمول الموجزة والتقنية باستخدام TypeScript و React Native و Expo، مستفيدًا من أنماط البرمجة الوظيفية والتصريحية من أجل كتابة كود متوافق وفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing high-performance mobile applications with React Native","Creating modular and reusable UI components with Expo","Writing concise and technical TypeScript code for mobile UI development"],"zh":["使用React Native开发高性能的移动应用程序","使用Expo创建模块化和可重用的UI组件","为移动UI开发编写简洁和技术性的TypeScript代码"],"ja":["React Nativeを使用して高性能のモバイルアプリケーションを開発する","Expoを使用してモジュラーで再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを作成する","モバイルUI開発のために簡潔で技術的なTypeScriptコードを記述する"],"ko":["React Native를 사용하여 고성능 모바일 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것","Expo를 사용하여 모듈화되고 재사용 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","모바일 UI 개발을 위해 간결하고 기술적인 TypeScript 코드를 작성하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento con React Native","Crear componentes de UI modulares y reutilizables con Expo","Escribir código técnico y conciso de TypeScript para el desarrollo de UI móvil"],"fr":["Développer des applications mobiles hautes performances avec React Native","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur modulaires et réutilisables avec Expo","Écrire du code technique et concis de TypeScript pour le développement d''interface utilisateur mobile"],"de":["Entwicklung von Hochleistungs-Mobile-Anwendungen mit React Native","Erstellen von modularen und wiederverwendbaren UI-Komponenten mit Expo","Schreiben von präzisem und technischem TypeScript-Code für die Entwicklung von mobiler UI"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações móveis de alto desempenho com React Native","Criar componentes de UI modulares e reutilizáveis com Expo","Escrever código TypeScript conciso e técnico para desenvolvimento de UI móvel"],"ru":["Разработка высокопроизводительных мобильных приложений с помощью React Native","Создание модульных и многоразовых компонентов UI с помощью Expo","Написание краткого и технического кода TypeScript для разработки мобильных приложений UI"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات محمول عالية الأداء باستخدام React Native","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المتوافقة والقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع Expo","كتابة كود TypeScript موجز و تقني لتطوير واجهة المستخدم المحمول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript, React Native, and Expo","Limited to mobile UI application development"],"zh":["需要TypeScript、React Native和Expo的知识","仅限于移动UI应用程序开发"],"ja":["TypeScript、React Native、Expoの知識が必要","モバイルUIアプリケーション開発に限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript, React Native, Expo에 대한 지식이 필요","모바일 UI 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript, React Native y Expo","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de interfaz de usuario móvil"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en TypeScript, React Native et Expo","Limité au développement d''applications d''interface utilisateur mobile"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in TypeScript, React Native und Expo","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von mobilen UI-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript, React Native e Expo","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações de UI móvel"],"ru":["Требует знаний TypeScript, React Native и Expo","Ограничен разработкой мобильных приложений UI"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ب TypeScript و React Native و Expo","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات واجهة المستخدم المحمول"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c066cce39501c12ccc3119a41ce187ee29a7