 OSにおいてMCPサーバーを管理するスキルで、Filesystem、Docker、n8nが含まれます","ko":"MCP Mastery는 A''Space OS에서 MCP 서버를 관리하기 위한 기술로, 파일 시스템, Docker 및 n8n을 포함합니다","es":"mcp_mastery es una habilidad que permite la maestría de los servidores MCP para agents A''Space OS","fr":"mcp_mastery est une compétence qui permet la maîtrise des serveurs MCP pour les agents A''Space OS","de":"mcp_mastery ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Beherrschung von MCP-Servern für A''Space-OS-Agents ermöglicht","pt":"mcp_mastery é uma habilidade de automação que utiliza n8n, Docker e MCP para otimizar tarefas","ru":"mcp_mastery - навык автоматизации, использующий n8n, Docker и MCP для оптимизации задач ИИ Агентов","ar":"mcp_mastery هو مهارة آتمتة تستخدم n8n و Docker و MCP لتحسين المهام لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes `list_tools` command for discovering available MCP tools","Prioritizes native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs for n8n connectivity","Configures MCP server with URL `http://localhost:5678` and Bearer Token authentication","Supports autonomous agent orchestration for Life OS, Business OS, and Kernel","Employs Docker for containerization and n8n for workflow automation","Enables ANTIGRAVITY MCP PROTOCOL for advanced agent management"],"zh":["支持Filesystem、Docker和n8n","使用`list_tools`进行Discovery","优先使用native MCP server","配置URL和Auth","支持Bearer Token认证"],"ja":["Filesystem、Docker、n8nをサポート","`list_tools`を使用してDiscoveryを実行","ネイティブMCPサーバーを優先","URLとAuthを設定","Bearer Token認証をサポート"],"ko":["파일 시스템, Docker 및 n8n 지원","`list_tools`를 사용하여 Discovery 수행","네이티브 MCP 서버 우선","URL 및 인증 구성","Bearer Token 인증 지원"],"es":["Soporte para Filesystem","Integración con Docker","Conectividad con n8n","Autenticación con Bearer Token","Configuración de URL y autenticación"],"fr":["Prise en charge de Filesystem","Intégration avec Docker","Connectivité avec n8n","Authentification avec Bearer Token","Configuration de l''URL et de l''authentification"],"de":["Unterstützung für Filesystem","Integration mit Docker","Konnektivität mit n8n","Authentifizierung mit Bearer Token","Konfiguration von URL und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Automação de tarefas com n8n","Integração com Docker","Utilização de MCP para otimizar a produtividade","Configuração de URL e autenticação com Bearer Token","Priorização do servidor MCP nativo sobre Webhooks/APIs"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач с n8n","Интеграция с Docker","Использование MCP для оптимизации производительности ИИ Агентов","Настройка URL и аутентификации с Bearer Token","Приоритизация родного сервера MCP над Webhooks/APIs"],"ar":["آتمتة المهام مع n8n","التكامل مع Docker","استخدام MCP لتحسين الإنتاجية لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد URL والتحقق من البearer Token","التفضيل للخادم MCP الأصلي على Webhooks/APIs"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use mcp_mastery","mcp_mastery setup guide","mcp_mastery alternative","mcp_mastery vs n8n","what is mcp_mastery","mcp_mastery install","A''Space OS agent management","MCP server configuration","autonomous agent orchestration"],"zh":["MCP Mastery","AIエージェント工具","A''Space OS","Filesystem","Docker","n8n","MCP服务器管理","Discovery","Connectivity","Configuration"],"ja":["MCPマスタリー","AIエージェント","A''Space OS","Filesystem","Docker","n8n","MCPサーバー管理","Discovery","Connectivity","Configuration"],"ko":["MCP Mastery","AI 에이전트 도구","A''Space OS","파일 시스템","Docker","n8n","MCP 서버 관리","Discovery","Connectivity","Configuration"],"es":["mcp_mastery","agents A''Space OS","servidores MCP","Filesystem","Docker","n8n","Bearer Token","autenticación","configuración de URL"],"fr":["mcp_mastery","agents A''Space OS","serveurs MCP","Filesystem","Docker","n8n","Bearer Token","authentification","configuration de l''URL"],"de":["mcp_mastery","A''Space-OS-Agents","MCP-Server","Filesystem","Docker","n8n","Bearer Token","Authentifizierung","URL-Konfiguration"],"pt":["mcp_mastery","automação de tarefas","n8n","Docker","MCP","produtividade","infraestrutura","otimização","configuração"],"ru":["mcp_mastery","автоматизация задач","n8n","Docker","MCP","производительность","инфраструктура","оптимизация","настройка","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["mcp_mastery","آتمتة المهام","n8n","Docker","MCP","الإنتاجية","البنية التحتية","تحسين","إعداد","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Amdkn","repo":"aspace_amiral","repoPath":"Amdkn/aspace_amiral","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.568Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mcp_mastery","description":"Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, Browser) pour les agents ASpace OS.","bodyPreview":"---\ndescription: Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, n8n) pour les agents A''Space OS.\nname: mcp_mastery\n---\n\n# MCP Mastery Skill\n\n## 📡 ANTIGRAVITY MCP PROTOCOL\n1. **Discovery**: Always check for available MCP tools using `list_tools` (or equivalent) at the start of a task.\n2. **Connectivity**: For `n8n`, prioritize the native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs.\n3. **Configuration**:\n   - URL: `http://localhost:5678` (Internal R1)\n   - Auth: Bearer Token (Personal Access Token from n8n Set","body":"---\ndescription: Maîtrise des serveurs MCP (Filesystem, Docker, n8n) pour les agents A''Space OS.\nname: mcp_mastery\n---\n\n# MCP Mastery Skill\n\n## 📡 ANTIGRAVITY MCP PROTOCOL\n1. **Discovery**: Always check for available MCP tools using `list_tools` (or equivalent) at the start of a task.\n2. **Connectivity**: For `n8n`, prioritize the native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs.\n3. **Configuration**:\n   - URL: `http://localhost:5678` (Internal R1)\n   - Auth: Bearer Token (Personal Access Token from n8n Settings).\n4. **Resilience**: If an MCP tool fails, fallback to Shell commands only if explicitly allowed by the Manager.\n\n## 🛠️ N8N MCP MASTER-CLASS\n- **Exhibition**: Every workflow must have the \"Enable MCP access\" toggle ON in n8n.\n- **Triggers**: Use `Webhook` or `Chat` triggers to expose functionality to the AI.\n- **Validation**: Test persistence using the `agent_signals` table audit after each MCP execution.\n\n## ⚖️ GOUVERNANCE\n- Never invent tools.\n- Log raw technical errors in `tracks.md`.\n- Adhere to the Universal File Resolution Protocol for all file operations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:43.094Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing efficient orchestration of A''Space OS components on MCP servers","zh":"适用于需要在MCP服务器上高效编排A''Space OS组件的自主代理","ja":"MCPサーバー上のA''Space OSコンポーネントの効率的なオーケストレーションを必要とする自律エージェントに適しています","ko":"MCP 서버에서 A''Space OS 컴포넌트를 효율적으로 오케스트레이션하는 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan una orquestación eficiente de los componentes de A''Space OS en servidores MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin d''une orchestration efficace des composants A''Space OS sur les serveurs MCP","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die eine effiziente Orchestrierung von A''Space OS-Komponenten auf MCP-Servern benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de orquestração eficiente de componentes do A''Space OS em servidores MCP","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов, которым требуется эффективная оркестрация компонентов A''Space OS на серверах MCP","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأوتوماتيكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق فعال لمكونات A''Space OS على خادم MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master MCP servers using native protocols like ANTIGRAVITY MCP, prioritizing n8n''s native MCP server over Webhooks/APIs, and configuring with Bearer Token authentication","zh":"赋予代理使用ANTIGRAVITY MCP等原生协议掌握MCP服务器的能力，优先使用n8n的原生MCP服务器而不是Webhooks/API，并使用Bearer Token身份验证进行配置","ja":"ANTIGRAVITY MCPなどのネイティブプロトコルを使用してMCPサーバーをマスターするエージェントの能力を付与し、Webhooks/APIよりもn8nのネイティブMCPサーバーを優先し、Bearer Token認証で構成します","ko":"ANTIGRAVITY MCP와 같은 네이티브 프로토콜을 사용하여 MCP 서버를 마스터하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Webhooks/API보다 n8n의 네이티브 MCP 서버를 우선하며, Bearer Token 인증으로 구성합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar los servidores MCP utilizando protocolos nativos como ANTIGRAVITY MCP, priorizando el servidor MCP nativo de n8n sobre Webhooks/APIs, y configurando con autenticación de Token Bearer","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les serveurs MCP en utilisant des protocoles natifs comme ANTIGRAVITY MCP, en donnant la priorité au serveur MCP natif de n8n par rapport aux Webhooks/API, et en configurant avec une authentification par jeton Bearer","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, MCP-Server mithilfe von nativen Protokollen wie ANTIGRAVITY MCP zu beherrschen, wobei der native MCP-Server von n8n Vorrang vor Webhooks/APIs hat und mit Bearer-Token-Authentifizierung konfiguriert wird","pt":"Habilita agentes a dominar servidores MCP usando protocolos nativos como ANTIGRAVITY MCP, priorizando o servidor MCP nativo do n8n sobre Webhooks/APIs, e configurando com autenticação de Token Bearer","ru":"Позволяет агентам освоить серверы MCP, используя родные протоколы, такие как ANTIGRAVITY MCP, отдавая предпочтение родному серверу MCP n8n над Webhooks/API, и настраивая с помощью аутентификации по токену Bearer","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من السيطرة على خوادم MCP باستخدام بروتوكولات محلية مثل ANTIGRAVITY MCP، وأعطاء الأولوية للخادم MCP المحلي n8n على الويب هوك / واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، وتهيئته باستخدام مصادقة رمز الحامل"},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating A''Space OS components on MCP servers","Configuring n8n workflows with native MCP server connectivity","Debugging MCP server issues using list_tools and native protocols"],"zh":["在MCP服务器上编排A''Space OS组件","使用原生MCP服务器连接配置n8n工作流","使用list_tools和原生协议调试MCP服务器问题"],"ja":["MCPサーバー上のA''Space OSコンポーネントのオーケストレーション","ネイティブMCPサーバー接続を使用してn8nワークフローを構成する","list_toolsとネイティブプロトコルを使用してMCPサーバーの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["MCP 서버에서 A''Space OS 컴포넌트를 오케스트레이션하는 것","네이티브 MCP 서버 연결을 사용하여 n8n 워크플ロー 구성","list_tools와 네이티브 프로토콜을 사용하여 MCP 서버 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Orquestar componentes de A''Space OS en servidores MCP","Configurar flujos de trabajo de n8n con conectividad de servidor MCP nativa","Depurar problemas del servidor MCP utilizando list_tools y protocolos nativos"],"fr":["Orchestrer les composants A''Space OS sur les serveurs MCP","Configurer les flux de tr