ault Manager для улучшения организации и открытия знаний в ваших хранилищах Obsidian","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد مدير خزنة المكتبات لتحسين تنظيم واكتشاف المعرفة في خزائن Obsidian الخاصة بك"},"definition":{"en":"librarian-vault-manager is a compounding knowledge system that combines structural organization with emergent meaning, augmented by AI librarian agents for maintenance","zh":"Librarian Vault Manager 是一个使用 AI 力量管理 Obsidian Vault 的知识管理系统","ja":"Librarian Vault Manager は、AI エージェントによる Obsidian Vault 管理の知識管理システムです","ko":"Librarian Vault Manager 는 AI 에이전트 기반의 Obsidian Vault 관리 지식 관리 시스템입니다","es":"Librarian Vault Manager es un sistema de conocimiento que utiliza agentes de IA para mantener la integridad estructural de los vaults de Obsidian","fr":"Librarian Vault Manager est un système de connaissances qui utilise des agents IA pour maintenir l''intégrité structurelle des vaults Obsidian","de":"Librarian Vault Manager ist ein Wissenssystem, das IA-Agenten verwendet, um die strukturelle Integrität von Obsidian-Vaults zu erhalten","pt":"O que é um Gerenciador de Vault de Bibliotecário? É um sistema de conhecimento que gerencia vaults Obsidian com Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Librarian Vault Manager? Это система знаний, которая управляет хранилищами Obsidian с помощью Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten","ar":"ما هو مدير خزنة المكتبات؟ هو نظام معرفي يدير خزائن Obsidian باستخدام Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten"},"features":{"en":["Structures Obsidian vaults using Johnny Decimal methodology","Integrates Zettelkasten for emergent meaning and knowledge development","Utilizes AI librarian agents for automated vault maintenance","Guides users through maintenance and knowledge development tasks via Gemini CLI","Prioritizes preservation of knowledge and structural integrity of the vault"],"zh":["使用 Johnny Decimal 方法ology 结构化组织","使用 Zettelkasten 方法ology 实现 emergent 意义","结合 AI 力量进行维护和知识开发","支持 Obsidian Vault 多个库管理","使用 Gemini CLI 作为知识管理界面","优先考虑知识的保存和结构完整性"],"ja":["Johnny Decimal 方法ology による構造化組織","Zettelkasten 方法ology による emergent 意義の実現","AI エージェントによるメンテナンスと知識開発","Obsidian Vault の多数のライブラリ管理のサポート","Gemini CLI による知識管理インターフェース","知識の保存と構造的完全性の優先化"],"ko":["Johnny Decimal 방법론을 통한 구조화된 조직","Zettelkasten 방법론을 통한 emergent 의미의 구현","AI 에이전트를 통한 유지 보수 및 지식 개발","Obsidian Vault 의 여러 라이브러리 관리 지원","Gemini CLI 를 통한 지식 관리 인터페이스","지식의 보존 및 구조적 완전성의 우선순위"],"es":["Gestión de múltiples vaults de Obsidian","Integración de Johnny Decimal para la organización estructural","Uso de Zettelkasten para el descubrimiento de significados emergentes","Mantenimiento automatizado con agentes de biblioteca de IA","Compatibilidad con Gemini CLI para tareas de mantenimiento y desarrollo de conocimientos"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs vaults Obsidian","Intégration de Johnny Decimal pour l''organisation structurelle","Utilisation de Zettelkasten pour la découverte de significations émergentes","Maintenance automatisée avec des agents de bibliothèque IA","Compatibilité avec Gemini CLI pour les tâches de maintenance et de développement de connaissances"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Obsidian-Vaults","Integration von Johnny Decimal für die strukturelle Organisation","Verwendung von Zettelkasten für die Entdeckung von emergenten Bedeutungen","Automatisierte Wartung mit IA-Bibliotheksagenten","Kompatibilität mit Gemini CLI für Wartungs- und Wissensentwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de múltiplos vaults Obsidian","Combinação de Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten","Manutenção da integridade estrutural dos vaults","Descoberta de conhecimento com AI","Integração com Gemini CLI"],"ru":["Управление несколькими хранилищами Obsidian","Сочетание Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten","Поддержание целостности структуры хранилищ","Обнаружение знаний с помощью ИИ","Интеграция с Gemini CLI"],"ar":["إدارة العديد من خزائن Obsidian","مزيج من Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten","صيانة السلامة الهيكلية للخزائن","اكتشاف المعرفة مع AI","التكامل مع Gemini CLI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use librarian-vault-manager","librarian-vault-manager setup guide","librarian-vault-manager alternative","librarian-vault-manager vs other knowledge management tools","librarian-vault-manager install","what is librarian-vault-manager","librarian-vault-manager for Obsidian vault management","AI librarian agents for knowledge management","Gemini CLI for librarian-vault-manager"],"zh":["Librarian Vault Manager","AI 에ージェнт","知识管理系统","Obsidian Vault","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","AI 力量","结构化组织","emergent 意义"],"ja":["Librarian Vault Manager","AI エージェント","知識管理システム","Obsidian Vault","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","AI 力量","構造化組織","emergent 意義"],"ko":["Librarian Vault Manager","AI 에이전트","지식 관리 시스템","Obsidian Vault","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","AI 기반","구조화된 조직","emergent 의미"],"es":["Librarian Vault Manager","Obsidian vaults","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","agentes de IA","Gemini CLI","gestión de conocimiento","organización estructural","mantenimiento automatizado"],"fr":["Librarian Vault Manager","vaults Obsidian","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","agents IA","Gemini CLI","gestion des connaissances","organisation structurelle","maintenance automatisée"],"de":["Librarian Vault Manager","Obsidian-Vaults","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","IA-Agenten","Gemini CLI","Wissensmanagement","strukturelle Organisation","automatisierte Wartung"],"pt":["Gerenciador de Vault de Bibliotecário","Obsidian","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","AI para desenvolvedores","Ferramentas de conhecimento","Sistemas de conhecimento composto"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Librarian Vault Manager","Obsidian","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","ИИ для разработчиков","Инструменты знаний","Составные системы знаний"],"ar":["مدير خزنة المكتبات","Obsidian","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Gemini CLI","AI للمطورين","أدوات المعرفة","نظم معرفية مركبة"]}},"owner":"jabez007","repo":"johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","repoPath":"jabez007/johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.575Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"librarian-vault-manager","description":"Knowledge steward for Johnny Decimal/Zettelkasten Obsidian vaults. Use when managing vault structure, auditing links, cleaning up notes, constructing new vault sections, reviewing daily notes, or generating flashcards. Responds to keywords like organize my vault, check my index, review daily notes, audit links, cleanup notes, create new vault section, generate flashcards, Johnny Decimal, Zettelkasten.","bodyPreview":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting","body":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting as the Librarian, must adhere strictly to the following:\n\n- **Read-Only Analysis and Proposals:** Gemini CLI **MUST NEVER** create, modify, or delete files directly without a preceding proposal phase. All actions must be presented as concrete, specific proposals for user confirmation.\n- **Explicit User Approval:** Always await explicit user approval before executing any file operations.\n- **Respect ACID Notation:** All proposals concerning note identifiers, titles, and locations must strictly follow the `SYS.AC.ID` format (Area, Category, ID).\n- **Adherence to Vault Guidelines:** Consult and follow the guidelines in `references/copilot-instructions.md` for identity format, atomicity, titles, links, and hierarchy.\n- **Maintain JDex Integrity:**\n  - The `00.00.md` root index must exist and link to the root base file.\n  - Every system must have a `SYS.00.00.md` index linking back to root.\n  - `_SYS/` folder stores all configuration (`.base`) files.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Architecture**\n\nThis project contains multiple Obsidian vaults in the `vaults/` directory.\n\n### **Vault Selection**\n\n- When a user request lacks explicit vault context, ask: \"Which vault should I work with?\"\n- Accepted vault identifiers: `[vault-name]` from `vaults/[vault-name]/`\n- Always confirm vault scope before proposing structural changes\n\n### **Path Resolution**\n\n- All `SYS.AC.ID` references and file paths are **vault-relative**\n- Translate user intent into paths like: `vaults/[vault-name]/SYS/A0-Area/...`\n- Never propose paths outside the selected vault''s boundaries\n\n### **Reference Document Lookup**\n\n- All workflow and reference documents are located at the project root: `.gemini/skills/librarian-vault-manager/references/`\n- This includes vault guidelines (`copilot-instructions.md`), workflows (`audit-links.md`, `cleanup.md`, etc.), and methodologies.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Guardrails**\n\n- **Do not** modify notes in multiple vaults without explicit per-vault confirmation\n- **Do not** create cross-vault links without user acknowledgment\n- **Do not** propose structural changes that assume a single JDex\n- **Always** confirm vault scope before proposing file operations\n\n## **Using the Librarian Skill**\n\nThis skill is designed to guide you through various vault management tasks. Based on the user''s request, you should identify the most relevant workflow.\n\n### **Workflow Selection**\n\nWhen a user''s request matches one of the following, read the corresponding workflow document for detailed instructions:\n\n- **Auditing Links / Strengthening Knowledge Graph**: If the user asks to \"audit links\", \"check for orphaned notes\", \"strengthen connections\", or similar, read `references/workflows/audit-links.md`.\n- **Cleaning Up / Maintaining Hygiene**: If the user asks to \"clean up vault\", \"detect duplicates\", \"flag naming issues\", \"relocate notes\", or similar, read `references/workflows/cleanup.md`.\n- **Constructing New Vault Sections**: If the user asks to \"scaffold a new vault\", \"create a new system/area/category\", or \"construct vault structure\", read `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.\n- **Daily Review / Extracting Durable Knowledge**: If the user asks to \"review daily notes\", \"extract concepts from daily notes\", or \"identify recurring themes\", read `references/workflows/daily-review.md`.\n- **Generating Flashcards**: If the user asks to \"generate flashcards\" for a note, read `references/workflows/flashcards.md`.\n\n### **General Reference**\n\nFor general understanding of the vault''s underlying methodologies and specific rules, consult the following documents as needed:\n\n- **Johnny Decimal System**: `references/johnny-decimal.md`\n- **Zettelkasten Method**: `references/zettelkasten.md`\n- **Vault Philosophy**: `references/philosophy.md`\n- **Copilot Instructions (Vault Guidelines)**: `references/copilot-instructions.md`\n\n## **Available Tools**\n\nIf available, this skill should use the `gemini-obsidian` extension tools for all vault interactions. The `vault_path` argument must always be passed to these tools.\nIf the `gemini-obsidian` extension is not availabe, this skill falls back to these tools: `read_file`, `list_directory`, `search_file_content` for analysis, and `write_file` (or `replace`) to execute changes after user confirmation.\n\n### Tool Usage Guidelines\n\n**1. Analysis $ Discovery**\n\n- **Keyword Search:** Use `obsidian_search_notes` to find specific SYS.AC.IDs (e.g., \"LIFE.12.01\") or tags.\n- **Concept Discovery:** Use `obsidian_rag_query` when asked to \"find similar ideas\" or \"check for existing knowledge.\" This can be used to enhance the keyword search for Zettelkasten management.\n- **Note Content:** Use `obsidian_read_note` to inspect both the Markdown and the YAML frontmatter.\n\n**2. Modification (REQUIRES PROPOSAL)**\n\n- **Metadata Updates:** Use `obsidian_update_frontmatter` for SYS.AC.ID changes, tag cleanup, or status updates.\n- **Creating Notes:** Use `obsidian_create_note`. You must determine the correct System and Johnny-Decimal folder before proposing.\n- **Note Relocation:** Use `obsidian_move_note` when a note''s Johnny-Decimal category changes.\n\n## **Example Scenario**\n\n**User Request:** \"Create a new vault for my Personal Finance.\"  \n**Gemini CLI Action:**\n\n1. Recognize \"Create a new vault\" intent.\n2. `read_file` `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.\n3. Analyze the prompt to discover the system (\"FIN\" or \"MONEY\").\n4. Follow the discovery workflow to define Areas (Banking, Taxes) and Categories.\n5. Propose the full structure including `00.00.md` and `_SYS/`.\n6. Upon \"Approve\", use `write_file` to generate the folders, indexes, and `.base` files.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:48.222Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Management Agents needing structured content organization using Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies.","zh":"适合需要使用 Johnny Decimal 和 Zettelkasten 方法论进行结构化内容组织的知识管理代理。","ja":"Johnny Decimal と Zettelkasten の方法論を使用した構造化されたコンテンツの組織化が必要なナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"조직화된 콘텐츠 구성이 필요한 지식 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Johnny Decimal 및 Zettelkasten 방법론을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión del conocimiento que necesitan organización de contenido estructurado utilizando las metodologías Johnny Decimal y Zettelkasten.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion des connaissances ayant besoin d''une organisation de contenu structurée utilisant les méthodologies Johnny Decimal et Zettelkasten.","de":"Ideal für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die eine strukturierte Inhaltsorganisation unter Verwendung der Johnny Decimal- und Zettelkasten-Methoden benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de organização de conteúdo estruturada usando metodologias Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, требующих структурированной организации контента с использованием методологий Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten.","ar":"مثالي لعمال وكالات إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى تنظيم المحتوى المنظم باستخدام منهجيات Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain Obsidian vaults with integrity, guiding users through knowledge development and vault maintenance tasks using Gemini CLI, while prioritizing knowledge preservation and structural integrity.","zh":"赋予代理维护 Obsidian 金库的完整性，通过 Gemini CLI 指导用户完成知识开发和金库维护任务，同时优先考虑知识保护和结构完整性。","ja":"Gemini CLI を使用して、エージェントが Obsidian の保管庫を完全性を持って維持できるようにし、ナレッジの開発および保管庫のメンテナンス タスクをユーザーに案内し、ナレッジの保存と構造的完全性を優先します。","ko":"에이전트가 Gemini CLI를 사용하여 Obsidian 금고를 무결성으로 유지할 수 있도록 하며, 지식 개발 및 금고 유지 관리 작업을 사용자에게 指導同时, 지식 보존 및 구조적 무결성을 우선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para mantener bóvedas Obsidian con integridad, guiando a los usuarios a través de tareas de desarrollo y mantenimiento de conocimientos y bóvedas utilizando Gemini CLI, priorizando la preservación y la integridad estructural del conocimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des coffres Obsidian avec intégrité, en guidant les utilisateurs à travers les tâches de développement et de maintenance des connaissances et des coffres en utilisant Gemini CLI, en donnant la priorité à la préservation et à l''intégrité structurelle des connaissances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Obsidian-Tresore mit Integrität zu warten, indem Benutzer durch Aufgaben der Wissensentwicklung und Wartung von Tresoren unter Verwendung von Gemini CLI geführt werden, wobei der Schutz und die strukturelle Integrität des Wissens priorisiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manterem cofres Obsidian com integridade, orientando os usuários através do desenvolvimento do conhecimento e tarefas de manutenção do cofre usando Gemini CLI, priorizando a preservação do conhecimento e a integridade estrutural.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать хранилища Obsidian с целостностью, руководя пользователями через развитие знаний и задачи по обслуживанию хранилища с использованием Gemini CLI, отдаляя приоритет сохранению знаний и структурной целостности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من الحفاظ على خزائن Obsidian مع السلامة، وتوجيه المستخدمين من خلال تطوير المعرفة ومهام صيانة الخزانة باستخدام Gemini CLI، مع إعطاء الأولوية لحفظ المعرفة والسلامة الهيكلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing knowledge bases with Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten structures","Maintaining Obsidian vaults for optimal discoverability","Assisting developers in knowledge development and vault maintenance"],"zh":["使用 Johnny Decimal 和 Zettelkasten 结构组织知识库","维护 Obsidian 金库以实现最佳的可发现性","协助开发人员进行知识开发和金库维护"],"ja":["Johnny Decimal と Zettelkasten の構造を使用してナレッジベースを組織化する","Obsidian の保管庫を最適な検出可能性のために維持する","開発者がナレッジの開発と保管庫のメンテナンスを支援する"],"ko":["Johnny Decimal 및 Zettelkasten 구조를 사용하여 지식베이스를 구성하는 것","Obsidian 금고를 최적의 검색 가능성을 위해 유지하는 것","개발자가 지식 개발 및 금고 관리를 지원하는 것"],"es":["Organizar bases de conocimiento con estructuras Johnny Decimal y Zettelkasten","Mantener bóvedas Obsidian para una descubrimiento óptimo","Asistir a los desarrolladores en el desarrollo y mantenimiento de conocimientos y bóvedas"],"fr":["Organiser des bases de connaissances avec des structures Johnny Decimal et Zettelkasten","Maintenir des coffres Obsidian pour une découverte optimale","Aider les développeurs dans le développement et la maintenance des connaissances et des coffres"],"de":["Wissensbasen mit Johnny Decimal- und Zettelkasten-Strukturen organisieren","Obsidian-Tresore für eine optimale Entdeckbarkeit warten","Entwicklern bei der Wissensentwicklung und Wartung von Tresoren helfen"],"pt":["Organizando bases de conhecimento com estruturas Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten","Mantendo cofres Obsidian para descoberta ótima","Auxiliando desenvolvedores no desenvolvimento do conhecimento e manutenção do cofre"],"ru":["Организация баз знаний с использованием структур Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten","Поддержание хранилищ Obsidian для оптимальной обнаруживаемости","Содействие разработчикам в развитии знаний и обслуживании хранилища"],"ar":["تنظيم قواعد المعرفة بstructures Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten","الحفاظ على خزائن Obsidian لاكتشاف مثالي","مساعدة المطورين في تطوير المعرفة وصيانة الخزانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gemini CLI","Limited to Obsidian vaults","Dependent on Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies"],"zh":["需要 Gemini CLI","仅限 Obsidian 金库","依赖于 Johnny Decimal 和 Zettelkasten 方法论"],"ja":["Gemini CLI が必要","Obsidian の保管庫のみ","Johnny Decimal と Zettelkasten の方法論に依存"],"ko":["Gemini CLI가 필요합니다","Obsidian 금고만 해당합니다","Johnny Decimal 및 Zettelkasten 방법론에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere Gemini CLI","Limitado a bóvedas Obsidian","Dependiente de las metodologías Johnny Decimal y Zettelkasten"],"fr":["Nécessite Gemini CLI","Limité aux coffres Obsidian","Dépendant des méthodologies Johnny Decimal et Zettelkasten"],"de":["Benötigt Gemini CLI","Begrenzt auf Obsidian-Tresore","Abhängig von den Johnny Decimal- und Zettelkasten-Methoden"],"pt":["Requer Gemini CLI","Limitado a cofres Obsidian","Dependente de metodologias Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten"],"ru":["Требует Gemini CLI","Ограничен хранилищами Obsidian","Зависит от методологий Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten"],"ar":["يتطلب Gemini CLI","محدود بخزائن Obsidian","يعتمد على منهجيات Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"94761795af6d8f3421d7c74583c89fa25b00d3a0d69ddf5c9be3e2a3c4bd8f95","qualityScore":32}');
