INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('reggiechan74/vp-real-estate/injurious-affection-assessment', 'injurious-affection-assessment', 'reggiechan74', 'vp-real-estate', 'community', 'injurious-affection-assessment reggiechan74 vp-real-estate community The injurious-affection-assessment skill provides detailed technical methodology for assessing damages from construction activities and permanent proximity impacts. It benefits experts in quantifying damages from infrastructure projects. injurious-affection-assessment是一种量化施工活动和永久接近影响的损害的技术方法，使用Claude Code进行租赁管理 injurious-affection-assessmentは、建設活動と永久接近影響による損害を評価するための技術方法です。Claude Codeを使用したリース管理も含みます injurious-affection-assessment는 건설 활동과 영구 근접 영향에 따른 손해를 평가하는 기술 방법입니다. Claude Code를 사용한 임대 관리도 포함됩니다 Evaluación de afección injuriosa para proyectos de construcción y infraestructura, utilizando Claude Code para medir y valorar daños específicos. Évaluation de l''affection injurieuse pour les projets de construction et d''infrastructure, utilisant Claude Code pour mesurer et évaluer des dommages spécifiques. Bewertung von schädlicher Beeinträchtigung für Bauprojekte und Infrastrukturprojekte, unter Verwendung von Claude Code zur Messung und Bewertung spezifischer Schäden. Avalie danos de construção e impactos de proximidade com nossa ferramenta de avaliação de afeto lesivo, utilizando Claude Code Оцените вредное воздействие строительных hoạtностей и постоянных близких воздействий с помощью нашего инструмента оценки вредного воздействия, основанного на Claude Code قيم الأضرار الناجمة عن الأنشطة الإنشائية والتأثيرات القريبة باستخدام أداة تقييم العواطف الضارة، مع تطبيق Claude Code how to use injurious-affection-assessment injurious-affection-assessment alternative what is injurious-affection-assessment injurious-affection-assessment setup guide quantifying damages from construction activities lease management using Claude Code injurious affection assessment methodology assessing business loss claims infrastructure project damage assessment injurious-affection-assessment 量化施工活动损害 永久接近影响评估 Claude Code租赁管理 技术方法论 噪音损害评估 灰尘损害评估 振动损害评估 交通损害评估 Provides technical depth on measuring and valuing specific types of injurious affection Assesses noise, dust, vibration, traffic, visual, and business loss claims Quantifies damages from construction and proximity impacts Offers detailed technical methodology for lease management using Claude Code Supports analysis of partial taking and infrastructure projects Enables experts to provide detailed damage assessments injurious-affection-assessment is a technical methodology for quantifying damages from construction activities and permanent proximity impacts, including noise, dust, vibration, traffic, visual, and business loss claims');
