INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('venikman/fpf-foundry/workflow/respond-to-approval', 'workflow/respond-to-approval', 'venikman', 'fpf-foundry', 'community', 'workflow/respond-to-approval venikman fpf-foundry community The workflow/respond-to-approval skill records approval decisions linked to prior approval requests, benefiting developers and auditors by providing a clear record of decisions. It supports inputs like context, session_id, and approval_id. workflow/respond-to-approval AI工具允许开发者记录审批决策，实现审计和审批请求的跟踪 AIエージェントを使用して、承認決定を記録し、監査性とゲートを実現することができます AI 에이전트를 사용하여 승인 결정을 기록하고 감사 및 게이트를 thực現할 수 있습니다 El skill de aprobación registra decisiones de aprobación para auditoría y control de flujos de trabajo, utilizando parámetros como context, session_id, approval_id y decision. Le skill d''approbation enregistre les décisions d''approbation pour l''audit et le contrôle des flux de travail, en utilisant des paramètres tels que context, session_id, approval_id et decision. Das Approval-Skill protokolliert Entscheidungen zu Genehmigungen für die Prüfbarkeit und die Steuerung von Workflows, unter Verwendung von Parametern wie context, session_id, approval_id und decision. O fluxo de trabalho de resposta a aprovação registra decisões de aprovação para auditoria e portais. Requer contexto, ID de sessão, ID de aprovação e decisão. Рабочий процесс ответа на одобрение регистрирует решения об одобрении для аудита и шлюзов. Требует контекста, идентификатора сеанса, идентификатора одобрения и решения. سير عمل الاستجابة للموافقة يسجل قرارات الموافقة من أجل التدقيق والبوابات. يتطلب سياقاً، ومعرف الجلسة، ومعرف الموافقة، وقراراً. how to use workflow/respond-to-approval workflow/respond-to-approval setup guide workflow/respond-to-approval alternative workflow/respond-to-approval vs approval workflow what is workflow/respond-to-approval workflow/respond-to-approval install workflow/respond-to-approval technical documentation approval decision recording with workflow/respond-to-approval streamlining approval workflows with workflow/respond-to-approval AI工具 workflow/respond-to-approval 记录审批决策 审计和审批请求的跟踪 bounded context name session identifier approval identifier approval decision Records approval decisions with inputs like context, session_id, and approval_id Supports approval decisions of approved, denied, or needs-review Allows specification of responder via the responded_by input Requires bounded context name as a safe path segment Utilizes session identifier as a safe path segment Integrates with approval identifiers as safe path segments workflow/respond-to-approval is a skill that records an approval decision linked to a prior approval request for auditability and gating purposes.');
